1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:06,870
I could be up here, I could be sharing about, um, the best prophetic words I've ever received, or the coolest healings I've ever seen.

2
00:00:07,590 --> 00:00:16,110
Eh, i ovdje bih mogao dijeliti o tome kako sam primio možda neke od najboljih riječi proroštava, ili kako sam vidio neke od

3
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:19,650
najljepših ozdravljenja kojima sam svjedočio.

4
00:00:20,190 --> 00:00:24,630
But tonight we were feeling that the Lord wanted to take us to a deeper heart place.

5
00:00:25,170 --> 00:00:29,610
Ali za večeras sam osjetio da nas Gospodin poziva da trebamo ući dublje u naša srca.

6
00:00:30,390 --> 00:00:41,130
Um, I'll be talking about healing within marriage, um, how—how I can conform myself to be more like Christ, for healing in marriage.

7
00:00:41,970 --> 00:00:50,370
Pričat ću o ozdravljenju u braku i o tome kako se mogu više suobličiti s Kristom da bi to ozdravljenje došlo u brak.

8
00:00:54,210 --> 00:00:57,270
Dobro je dan. Eh, did I do it?

9
00:00:58,230 --> 00:00:59,010
Je li bilo dobro?

10
00:01:01,410 --> 00:01:03,030
Are you ready to be humble tonight?

11
00:01:03,870 --> 00:01:07,650
Jeste li spremni, eh, da nas Gospodin

12
00:01:09,090 --> 00:01:10,650
dovede do poniznosti večeras?

13
00:01:11,730 --> 00:01:19,830
So as I was here praying, um, I was—I was looking at your altar here, which several of you have probably noticed before.

14
00:01:20,310 --> 00:01:28,230
Dok sam, dok sam bio ovdje večeras i molio, primijetio sam vaš oltar. Vjerujem da ga je i nekolicina vas isto primijetila.

15
00:01:28,530 --> 00:01:34,590
And I was just seeing the distinct numbers, 5 and 2. Do you see that?

16
00:01:34,770 --> 00:01:38,430
I vidio sam brojeve 5 i 2 koji su vidljivi.

17
00:01:38,670 --> 00:01:45,750
And I was asking the Lord what He meant by that, and what He wanted to speak to you guys here tonight on the altar that is your altar.

18
00:01:46,110 --> 00:01:51,330
I pitao sam Gospodina što želi progovoriti vama po tim brojkama i po oltaru koji je vaš oltar.

19
00:01:51,810 --> 00:01:55,650
And I felt like He was saying, "What you have to bring is enough."

20
00:01:56,310 --> 00:02:02,850
I osjetio sam da ono što trebamo donijeti sami, što možemo sami donijeti, da je to dovoljno.

21
00:02:03,630 --> 00:02:12,570
So in those areas where you're maybe like, "I'm not so gifted," or, "I don't have what this other person has."

22
00:02:12,810 --> 00:02:19,050
I u onim područjima gdje možda nemamo puno darova, ili možda nismo daroviti kao neka druga osoba.

23
00:02:19,950 --> 00:02:23,610
The Lord says, "Bring what you do have, and that's enough."

24
00:02:24,030 --> 00:02:27,210
Gospodin kaže: "Donesi ono što imaš, i to je dovoljno."

25
00:02:27,570 --> 00:02:30,150
Like the boy with the five loaves and the two fish.

26
00:02:30,390 --> 00:02:33,390
Kao dječak s pet kruhova i dvije ribice.

27
00:02:33,750 --> 00:02:37,350
He wants all of you, but He doesn't want something you don't have.

28
00:02:37,830 --> 00:02:41,070
Želi cijelog tebe, ali ne želi nešto što ti nemaš.

29
00:02:41,670 --> 00:02:42,630
That part's His job.

30
00:02:43,230 --> 00:02:44,370
Taj dio je Njegov posao.

31
00:02:45,450 --> 00:02:47,130
So, continuing on being humble.

32
00:02:47,970 --> 00:02:51,090
Uh, nastavljajući u stavu poniznosti.

33
00:02:51,750 --> 00:02:55,770
Uh, earlier, I've been in Croatia for about a week now.

34
00:02:55,950 --> 00:02:57,930
U Hrvatskoj sam otprilike 1 tjedan.

35
00:02:58,890 --> 00:03:04,470
Uh, within the first 3 days, I locked myself out of our hotel room.

36
00:03:05,250 --> 00:03:09,210
Uh, u prva 3 dana sam se zaključao izvan svoje hotelske sobe.

37
00:03:09,990 --> 00:03:12,030
Which my wife absolutely loved.

38
00:03:12,570 --> 00:03:14,490
U čemu je moja supruga potpuno uživala.

39
00:03:15,330 --> 00:03:20,850
And we had to sleep in a rectory. Fortunately, Father Ante N. Zaprešić came and got us.

40
00:03:21,270 --> 00:03:28,470
Bogu hvala, otac Ante i ostali su nam dopustili da spavamo u župnom stanu.

41
00:03:29,370 --> 00:03:31,590
And I also lost my passport.

42
00:03:31,710 --> 00:03:33,330
I izgubio sam svoju putovnicu.

43
00:03:34,590 --> 00:03:35,370
Didn't find it.

44
00:03:35,730 --> 00:03:36,810
Nisam je još pronašao.

45
00:03:37,770 --> 00:03:41,970
But I have an emergency passport that we got in the last day.

46
00:03:42,750 --> 00:03:46,110
I proš-jučer mi je došla hitna putovnica.

47
00:03:46,710 --> 00:03:50,610
So as I share tonight on marriage, it's still an active journey.

48
00:03:50,850 --> 00:03:54,930
I dok ću večeras govoriti o braku, to je i dalje još jedno aktivno putovanje.

49
00:03:55,350 --> 00:04:00,570
And if you think that we have it all together, just remember this from the start.

50
00:04:00,930 --> 00:04:05,790
I ako vam u jednom trenutku padne da smo sve—na pamet da smo sve posložili, sjetite se ovog početka.

51
00:04:06,390 --> 00:04:12,690
So how many of you were—was there anybody that was at the School of Prophetic Ministry in Zaprešić last week?

52
00:04:12,750 --> 00:04:15,270
Je li netko od vas bio u Zaprešiću, na školi proročkoj?

53
00:04:15,750 --> 00:04:18,510
Yeah. So we had so much—did you guys have fun?

54
00:04:18,930 --> 00:04:19,770
Je li vam bilo dobro?

55
00:04:19,950 --> 00:04:23,970
Yeah. Can you give, like, a little bit of a "yeah" if you had some fun?

56
00:04:26,070 --> 00:04:29,550
Više! I don't know if they believe you.

57
00:04:30,510 --> 00:04:31,530
Ne znam da li vam vjeruju.

58
00:04:32,550 --> 00:04:40,230
Um, coming from Encounter Ministries, there's—there's a lot of exciting things that we do.

59
00:04:40,770 --> 00:04:46,650
Kako dolazim iz službe Encounter, postoji puno jako zanimljivih stvari koje činimo i radimo.

60
00:04:47,130 --> 00:04:54,210
And I could be up here, I could be sharing about the best prophetic words I've ever received, or the coolest healings I've ever seen.

61
00:04:55,110 --> 00:05:03,450
I ovdje bih mogao dijeliti o tome kako sam primio možda neke od najboljih riječi proroštava, ili kako sam vidio neke od

62
00:05:04,830 --> 00:05:06,930
najljepših ozdravljenja kojima sam svjedočio.

63
00:05:07,470 --> 00:05:11,970
But tonight we were feeling that the Lord wanted to take us to a deeper heart place.

64
00:05:12,450 --> 00:05:16,950
Ali za večeras sam osjetio da nas Gospodin poziva da trebamo ući dublje u naša srca.

65
00:05:17,670 --> 00:05:22,290
Um, was there anybody who happened to come to the Vienna Encounter Conference?

66
00:05:22,410 --> 00:05:25,710
Je li netko od vas bio u Beču na Encounter konferenciji?

67
00:05:25,950 --> 00:05:32,310
Okay. Were either of you at the session that I led? Okay. You're going to hear the same story.

68
00:05:32,730 --> 00:05:33,930
Ti ćeš čuti istu priču.

69
00:05:35,010 --> 00:05:36,870
But it's okay. A second time is helpful.

70
00:05:37,290 --> 00:05:38,730
U redu je, drugi put isto pomaže.

71
00:05:39,150 --> 00:05:40,830
Um, how many in here are married?

72
00:05:41,070 --> 00:05:42,930
Koliko od vas je vjenčano, oženjeno?

73
00:05:44,010 --> 00:05:46,050
Yeah. Okay. A good number. A good number.

74
00:05:46,290 --> 00:05:46,770
Dobar broj.

75
00:05:47,010 --> 00:05:53,730
Um, and how many of you are—you're here to be here in ministry, but how many of you do active ministry?

76
00:05:53,970 --> 00:05:56,850
Koliko od vas vas ovdje na neki način aktivno služi?

77
00:05:58,650 --> 00:06:05,370
Okay. A fair amount of you. Okay. How many of you are in ministry but have a spouse who's not in ministry?

78
00:06:05,550 --> 00:06:09,810
Koliko od vas je služi, ali da mu suprug ili supruga ne služe?

79
00:06:12,030 --> 00:06:17,790
Praise the Lord! Let's go. Let's go. This is beautiful. What you are doing here is uncommon.

80
00:06:18,150 --> 00:06:22,170
Ovo je prekrasno. Ovo što vi ovdje činite nije—nije uobičajeno.

81
00:06:22,890 --> 00:06:30,450
So, um, what I want to share with you tonight is very grounded in personal testimony and in Scripture.

82
00:06:30,750 --> 00:06:36,210
Ono što želim s vama večeras podijeliti je duboko utemeljeno u osobnom iskustvu i u Bibliji.

83
00:06:36,570 --> 00:06:46,710
I'll be talking about healing within marriage, um, how—how I can conform myself to be more like Christ, for healing in marriage.

84
00:06:47,550 --> 00:06:55,950
Pričat ću o ozdravljenju u braku i o tome kako se mogu više suobličiti s Kristom da bi to ozdravljenje došlo u brak.

85
00:06:56,910 --> 00:07:07,410
When I started preparing this talk, actually over a year ago, I felt the Lord telling me, "It's time to share keys I shared with you, um, to help others in their marriages."

86
00:07:07,650 --> 00:07:17,850
Kad sam prije gotovo godinu dana počeo pripremati ovaj govor, Gospodin mi je rekao: "Vrijeme je da počneš dijeliti ključeve koje sam ti dao da bi drugima pomogao u njihovim brakovima."

87
00:07:18,210 --> 00:07:21,090
So tonight is going to be about a little bit of growth.

88
00:07:21,150 --> 00:07:23,010
Večeras će biti malo o rastu.

89
00:07:23,910 --> 00:07:25,590
Now, if you're not married.

90
00:07:26,250 --> 00:07:27,330
Ako niste vjenčani.

91
00:07:28,170 --> 00:07:31,830
Any—any consecrated people in the room, don't worry.

92
00:07:32,130 --> 00:07:35,070
Ako je bilo koja posvećena osoba ovdje u prostoriji, ne brinite.

93
00:07:35,370 --> 00:07:39,150
I just invite you to consider this in the context of family.

94
00:07:39,390 --> 00:07:42,690
Pozivam vas da ovo razmotrite u kontekstu vaše obitelji.

95
00:07:43,230 --> 00:07:47,190
So it could help you to intercede for those in your life that are married.

96
00:07:47,370 --> 00:07:52,290
Možete—može vam pomoći da zagovarate za one koji su u vašim životima vjenčani.

97
00:07:52,530 --> 00:07:54,390
Okay. Can we just start in a prayer? You guys—

98
00:07:54,450 --> 00:07:55,710
Možemo li započeti s molitvom?

99
00:07:55,770 --> 00:07:56,610
Do you like to pray?

100
00:07:56,850 --> 00:07:57,810
Je li volite moliti?

101
00:07:59,370 --> 00:07:59,550
Yes.

102
00:07:59,730 --> 00:08:03,090
Ah, there we go. Okay. You're with me. Okay. Father, Son, Holy Spirit.

103
00:08:03,150 --> 00:08:04,170
U ime Sina i Duha Svetoga.

104
00:08:04,230 --> 00:08:06,270
Amen. Come, Holy Spirit.

105
00:08:06,690 --> 00:08:07,710
Dođi, Duše Sveti.

106
00:08:07,950 --> 00:08:08,910
You are present here.

107
00:08:09,390 --> 00:08:10,350
Ovdje si prisutan.

108
00:08:11,370 --> 00:08:14,250
I just ask that you would do your work.

109
00:08:14,430 --> 00:08:15,810
Molim te da činiš svoja djela.

110
00:08:16,650 --> 00:08:19,050
Convict the hearts that need to be convicted.

111
00:08:19,590 --> 00:08:22,170
Uvjeravaj srca koja imaju potrebu za uvjeravanjem.

112
00:08:22,890 --> 00:08:23,550
Soften us.

113
00:08:24,330 --> 00:08:25,170
Omekšaj nas.

114
00:08:26,130 --> 00:08:28,590
Form us.

115
00:08:28,770 --> 00:08:29,490
Oblikuj nas.

116
00:08:30,630 --> 00:08:32,490
And lead us closer to your heart.

117
00:08:32,790 --> 00:08:34,290
I vodi nas bliže svome srcu.

118
00:08:35,190 --> 00:08:36,030
In Jesus' name.

119
00:08:36,210 --> 00:08:37,110
U Isusovo ime.

120
00:08:37,290 --> 00:08:37,530
Amen.

121
00:08:37,770 --> 00:08:38,010
Amen.

122
00:08:38,490 --> 00:08:39,690
Father, Son, Holy Spirit.

123
00:08:39,810 --> 00:08:40,230
Duše Sveti.

124
00:08:40,410 --> 00:08:44,310
Amen. Um, can I give you some context to this talk?

125
00:08:44,670 --> 00:08:46,710
Mogu li vam dati jedan kontekst o ovom govoru?

126
00:08:47,070 --> 00:08:50,070
Okay. So, 13 years ago, I—

127
00:08:50,070 --> 00:08:50,910
Prije 13 godina.

128
00:08:51,150 --> 00:08:53,970
I got married in Portland, Oregon, in the United States.

129
00:08:54,270 --> 00:08:57,870
Oženio sam se u Portlandu, savezna država Oregon, u SAD-u.

130
00:08:58,110 --> 00:08:59,670
And I was so excited.

131
00:08:59,850 --> 00:09:01,110
Bio sam jako uzbuđen.

132
00:09:01,590 --> 00:09:06,090
Um, I spent just about all my life savings on my wife's engagement ring.

133
00:09:06,990 --> 00:09:11,070
Potrošio sam svu ušteđevinu životnu na zaručnički prsten za suprugu.

134
00:09:11,310 --> 00:09:12,750
Which is the right decision.

135
00:09:12,930 --> 00:09:14,130
Što je ispravna odluka.

136
00:09:14,610 --> 00:09:15,810
So if you're not married yet.

137
00:09:16,470 --> 00:09:17,730
Ako još niste vjenčani.

138
00:09:18,150 --> 00:09:19,890
Pray about it, but that's advice for you.

139
00:09:20,250 --> 00:09:22,470
Molite nad time, ali to vam je savjet.

140
00:09:23,070 --> 00:09:26,070
But also, heading into marriage, I had some expectations.

141
00:09:26,250 --> 00:09:29,250
Ali kako smo ulazili u brak, imao sam određena očekivanja.

142
00:09:29,430 --> 00:09:30,930
I'll share what some of those are.

143
00:09:31,350 --> 00:09:33,210
Podijelit ću s vama neka od ovih.

144
00:09:33,750 --> 00:09:37,710
I expected many late nights of sharing about all my hopes and dreams.

145
00:09:38,430 --> 00:09:45,810
Uh, očekivao sam puno razgovora, noćnih, do dugo u noć, o svojim maštanjima i snovima.

146
00:09:46,110 --> 00:09:47,910
With my wife laughing at all my jokes.

147
00:09:48,150 --> 00:09:50,310
Dok se moja žena smije svim mojim šalama.

148
00:09:50,610 --> 00:09:52,290
And cheering on my accomplishments.

149
00:09:52,650 --> 00:09:55,470
I zahvaljuje mi i pohvaljuje me zbog svih mojih uspjeha.

150
00:09:55,770 --> 00:10:00,030
I expected these long periods of gazing, just batting eyelashes at each other.

151
00:10:00,270 --> 00:10:03,330
Očekivao sam duge, duga razdoblja samogledanja u oči.

152
00:10:03,630 --> 00:10:07,350
Because I don't know if you know this, but the name Kevin actually does mean "handsome."

153
00:10:07,770 --> 00:10:10,950
Ne znam da li znate, ali ime Kevin znači "zgodan."

154
00:10:11,610 --> 00:10:17,130
I also expected my wife would join me in all my hobbies, um, like—like running and exercising together.

155
00:10:17,670 --> 00:10:21,750
Uh, očekivao sam da će mi se žena pridružiti u svim mojim hobijima, kao što je trčanje i vježbanje.

156
00:10:22,110 --> 00:10:26,130
And I enjoyed making music, and I discovered my wife actually—she has a beautiful voice.

157
00:10:26,550 --> 00:10:30,690
Ja sam volio stvarati glazbu, i saznao sam da moja supruga ima prekrasan glas.

158
00:10:30,990 --> 00:10:33,510
So I thought we would be making music together.

159
00:10:33,690 --> 00:10:35,490
Mislio sam da ćemo zajedno stvarati glazbu.

160
00:10:36,570 --> 00:10:39,210
And then, of course, I expected great physical intimacy.

161
00:10:39,810 --> 00:10:42,690
I očekivao sam jako veliku fizičku intimnost.

162
00:10:42,990 --> 00:10:47,970
Uh, really just anticipating our honeymoon as just the peak manifestation of that.

163
00:10:48,210 --> 00:10:52,170
Očekujući da će naš medeni mjesec biti vrhunac svega toga.

164
00:10:53,130 --> 00:10:57,090
And all my expectations were met, and we lived happily ever after.

165
00:10:57,390 --> 00:11:00,690
I sva moja očekivanja su se ispunila, i živjeli smo sretno do kraja života.

166
00:11:00,930 --> 00:11:03,870
So I'll pass it over to Josip, and he'll—he'll lead you for the night.

167
00:11:04,110 --> 00:11:05,370
Sad će Josip nastaviti dalje.

168
00:11:06,570 --> 00:11:08,130
You're like, "What?" I'm kidding. I'm kidding.

169
00:11:08,310 --> 00:11:08,850
Šalim se.

170
00:11:09,870 --> 00:11:10,770
So that didn't happen.

171
00:11:11,190 --> 00:11:12,150
To se nije dogodilo.

172
00:11:12,450 --> 00:11:14,130
So what did I actually experience?

173
00:11:14,250 --> 00:11:15,090
Što sam doživio?

174
00:11:15,390 --> 00:11:21,630
Well, it turns out that my wife actually wanted me to take a season off of ministry when we got married.

175
00:11:21,930 --> 00:11:30,330
Uh, ono što se dogodilo je da je moja supruga željela da uzmem vrijeme, da prestanem sa služenjem kad smo se vjenčali.

176
00:11:30,810 --> 00:11:36,630
It also turns out that she had a prior leg injury, so she didn't want to exercise with me.

177
00:11:37,050 --> 00:11:41,010
I ispalo je da je prije toga imala jednu ozljedu noge, pa nije mogla vježbati sa mnom.

178
00:11:41,550 --> 00:11:48,810
And she loves singing and playing music that's already written, and finds writing music very anxiety-inducing.

179
00:11:49,470 --> 00:11:59,010
I voli pjevati glazbu koja je već—pjesme koje su već napisane, ali je jako prestravljena od toga da sama stvara glazbu i pjeva pjesmu.

180
00:11:59,370 --> 00:12:05,730
And when it came to physical intimacy, she was—she was very averse to it, um, but I didn't know why at the time.

181
00:12:05,970 --> 00:12:12,750
Kad je došlo do, uh, do fizičke intimnosti, bila je—to joj je bilo jako odbojno, iako nisam znao zašto u to vrijeme.

182
00:12:13,050 --> 00:12:18,210
But what I'd been told should have been the easiest part of the honeymoon was actually the biggest struggle for us.

183
00:12:18,390 --> 00:12:22,590
I ono što je trebalo biti najlakši dio medenog mjeseca, nama je bila najveća poteškoća.

184
00:12:23,250 --> 00:12:28,110
So just from some of these basic expectations, how many of you can relate to some of that?

185
00:12:28,230 --> 00:12:34,470
Koliko od vas se može povezati s nekim ovim osnovnim očekivanjima koja se nisu dogodila? Dignite ruku.

186
00:12:37,110 --> 00:12:38,850
Only a few. Some of you are lying.

187
00:12:39,210 --> 00:12:41,070
Samo par, a neki od vas lažu.

188
00:12:43,050 --> 00:12:48,030
So how do we get from common unmet expectations to spiritual complications?

189
00:12:48,210 --> 00:12:53,850
Kako dođemo od uobičajenih neostvarenih očekivanja do duhovnih komplikacija?

190
00:12:54,030 --> 00:12:57,390
Well, let me talk about the power of unmet expectations.

191
00:12:57,750 --> 00:13:00,270
Pričat ću o snazi neispunjenih očekivanja.

192
00:13:00,810 --> 00:13:07,170
Did any of you in your marriage preparation, those that are married, have to take a compatibility test with your spouse?

193
00:13:07,290 --> 00:13:15,330
Je li netko od vas pisao ili prolazio sa suprugom tekst test kompatibilnosti? Dignite ruku.

194
00:13:15,390 --> 00:13:15,810
Anyone?

195
00:13:16,290 --> 00:13:16,890
Bilo tko?

196
00:13:17,190 --> 00:13:20,790
No. Okay. In the United States, it's very common. It's very common.

197
00:13:20,850 --> 00:13:22,770
U Sjedinjenim Državama je to jako uobičajeno.

198
00:13:23,010 --> 00:13:26,430
Because the Church wants you to be prepared for what you're up against.

199
00:13:26,610 --> 00:13:29,550
Jer Crkva želi da budete pripremljeni za ono što vas čeka.

200
00:13:29,850 --> 00:13:37,230
So for us, my wife and I, we were—we were told to take this test, and we got the results, and we sat down with the priest.

201
00:13:37,950 --> 00:13:43,530
I meni—mojoj ženi i meni su dali da to riješimo, i onda smo sjeli nakon toga skupa sa svećenikom.

202
00:13:44,190 --> 00:13:45,570
And he looks at them, and he's like...

203
00:13:48,030 --> 00:13:49,050
Njegova reakcija je bila...

204
00:13:52,110 --> 00:13:55,890
Says, "Well, you guys scored opposite on almost everything."

205
00:13:56,430 --> 00:14:00,270
Rekao je: "Vaši rezultati su gotovo suprotni na svemu."

206
00:14:00,630 --> 00:14:02,790
But if you stick to Jesus, I guess you'll be fine.

207
00:14:03,210 --> 00:14:05,430
Ali ako se budete držali Isusa, bit će vam super.

208
00:14:06,150 --> 00:14:08,070
Which, there's some truth to that.

209
00:14:08,370 --> 00:14:09,750
Postoji nešto istine u tome.

210
00:14:10,170 --> 00:14:15,210
But when we enter marriage with all these unmet expectations, unmet hopes, what do you think happened?

211
00:14:15,450 --> 00:14:19,650
Ali kad smo ušli u brak sa svim ovim neispunjenim očekivanjima, što mislite, što se dogodilo?

212
00:14:20,010 --> 00:14:22,290
In the Bible, we call this "deferred hope."

213
00:14:23,130 --> 00:14:27,030
U Bibliji to zovemo "neispunjena nada."

214
00:14:27,390 --> 00:14:32,430
Yeah. Proverbs 13:12 says, "Hope deferred makes the heart sick."

215
00:14:33,270 --> 00:14:41,250
U Proverbs—u Izrekama 13:12 kaže: "Neispunjena nada čini srce bolesnim."

216
00:14:41,910 --> 00:14:42,090
Yeah.

217
00:14:42,210 --> 00:14:44,370
To je slobodni prijevod, ovako, nemam tu sad...

218
00:14:47,250 --> 00:14:47,970
Free translation.

219
00:14:48,450 --> 00:14:49,170
Free translation.

220
00:14:50,670 --> 00:14:56,310
That's awesome. But not only what you see on the outside.

221
00:14:56,610 --> 00:14:58,590
Ne samo ono što vidite na van.

222
00:14:59,070 --> 00:15:03,690
But often you can see on the inside. There's—there's disappointment, there's rejection, right?

223
00:15:04,170 --> 00:15:07,590
Iznutra isto se događa razočarenje, odbačenost.

224
00:15:07,770 --> 00:15:11,730
Because if what I expected doesn't happen, I—I have to do something with that.

225
00:15:11,910 --> 00:15:15,750
Jer ako ono što sam očekivao se nije dogodilo, moram nešto učiniti s time.

226
00:15:15,990 --> 00:15:21,390
I could feel let down, or—or rejected, or the desires of my heart are off.

227
00:15:21,690 --> 00:15:27,150
Ili mogu osjećati kao da sam izdan, odbačen, ili da su ugašene moje želje srca.

228
00:15:27,510 --> 00:15:30,750
Or maybe that I'm impressed by this person who won't agree with me.

229
00:15:30,990 --> 00:15:34,530
Ili da sam impresioniran ovom osobom koja se nikako ne može složiti sa mnom.

230
00:15:35,130 --> 00:15:39,630
Now, these are natural responses without God, without bringing it to God.

231
00:15:39,870 --> 00:15:45,030
I to su prirodne reakcije ako ih—ako te osjećaje ne prinesemo Bogu.

232
00:15:45,870 --> 00:15:49,770
Um, blessed vulnerable Fulton Sheen, very recent.

233
00:15:50,010 --> 00:15:53,550
Uh, blaženi Fulton Sheen, nedavno proglašen blaženim.

234
00:15:53,610 --> 00:15:57,270
He once said this: "It takes three to make love, not two."

235
00:15:57,630 --> 00:16:01,350
Rekao je: "Potrebno je troje da bi se vodila ljubav, ne dvoje."

236
00:16:01,650 --> 00:16:04,470
It's you, your spouse, and God.

237
00:16:05,070 --> 00:16:07,590
Ti, tvoja suprug ili supruga, i Bog.

238
00:16:08,130 --> 00:16:12,990
He says, "Without God, people only succeed in bringing out the worst in each other."

239
00:16:13,590 --> 00:16:17,910
Bez Boga, ljudi uspijevaju samo izvući najgore jedno iz drugoga.

240
00:16:18,630 --> 00:16:23,790
But on the other hand, with God, with Jesus, he brings light in your confusion.

241
00:16:24,330 --> 00:16:29,730
Ali na drugu stranu, s Bogom, s Isusom, on donosi svjetlo

242
00:16:31,170 --> 00:16:34,770
u vaše konfuzije, u vaše zbunjenosti.

243
00:16:34,950 --> 00:16:36,930
He reveals, "I'm going to make a way for you."

244
00:16:37,650 --> 00:16:39,330
Objavljuje nam put za nas.

245
00:16:39,570 --> 00:16:41,670
Or maybe he has a bigger gift than you expected.

246
00:16:41,910 --> 00:16:44,190
Ili možda ima veći dar nego što ste očekivali.

247
00:16:44,430 --> 00:16:47,790
Or maybe he's breaking you free from something that's actually not good for you.

248
00:16:48,090 --> 00:16:50,910
Ili te možda oslobađa od nečeg što uopće nije dobro za tebe.

249
00:16:51,270 --> 00:16:54,090
Because when Jesus speaks, he puts hope into your heart.

250
00:16:54,150 --> 00:16:57,210
Jer kad Isus progovara, on stavlja nadu u srce.

251
00:16:57,690 --> 00:17:01,350
The Catechism, in paragraph 1608, it says this.

252
00:17:01,650 --> 00:17:04,710
U Katekizmu 1608 kaže ovo.

253
00:17:05,250 --> 00:17:10,410
Says, "To heal the wounds of sin, man and woman need the help of the grace."

254
00:17:10,530 --> 00:17:12,810
Da bi se iscijelile rane grijeha,

255
00:17:14,490 --> 00:17:17,430
muškarac i žena trebaju pomoć milosti.

256
00:17:17,550 --> 00:17:20,430
That God, in his infinite mercy, never refuses them.

257
00:17:20,610 --> 00:17:24,510
Kojom Bog nikad ne uskraćuje u svojoj bezgraničnoj milosti.

258
00:17:24,870 --> 00:17:29,190
Without his help, man and woman cannot achieve the union of their lives.

259
00:17:29,730 --> 00:17:35,550
Bez Božje pomoći, muškarac i žena ne mogu postići jedinstvo u svome životu.

260
00:17:35,910 --> 00:17:38,010
For which God created them in the beginning.

261
00:17:38,430 --> 00:17:40,650
Za koje ih je Bog stvorio u početku.

262
00:17:41,070 --> 00:17:44,550
Because without his help, we often fight.

263
00:17:44,670 --> 00:17:46,650
Bez njegove pomoći se često svađamo.

264
00:17:47,010 --> 00:17:47,670
Or flight.

265
00:17:48,090 --> 00:17:48,810
Ili bježimo.

266
00:17:49,470 --> 00:17:53,250
If God's not our protector, we often fight for control.

267
00:17:53,430 --> 00:17:56,070
Ako Bog nije naš zaštitnik, borimo se za kontrolu.

268
00:17:56,490 --> 00:17:57,810
Or we withdraw, we hide.

269
00:17:58,290 --> 00:17:58,890
Ili se...

270
00:17:59,010 --> 00:17:59,550
For control.

271
00:17:59,730 --> 00:18:02,970
Ili se sklanjamo i skrivamo te kontrole.

272
00:18:03,570 --> 00:18:05,610
But in marriage, when you do this, what happens?

273
00:18:05,970 --> 00:18:08,070
A u braku, ako to učiniš, što se dogodi?

274
00:18:08,490 --> 00:18:09,570
It leads to isolation.

275
00:18:10,050 --> 00:18:11,070
Vodi do izolacije.

276
00:18:11,310 --> 00:18:11,730
To vision.

277
00:18:12,390 --> 00:18:13,890
Do odvojenosti.

278
00:18:14,970 --> 00:18:18,090
Well, who do you think likes isolation and division?

279
00:18:18,330 --> 00:18:21,750
Što mislite, kome se sviđa izolacija i odvojenost?

280
00:18:22,350 --> 00:18:25,830
How many of you think it's the one who said it's not good for the man to be alone?

281
00:18:26,490 --> 00:18:34,470
Što mislite, koliko—koliko od vas misli da je—da se izolacija i odvojenost sviđaju onom koji je rekao: "Za čovjeka nije dobro da bude sam."

282
00:18:36,630 --> 00:18:43,290
One. Uh-oh. How many of you think it's the one whose name in Greek means "to divide"? The devil.

283
00:18:43,290 --> 00:18:50,970
A koliko od vas misli da se to sviđa onomu koji—čije ime na grčkom znači "da razdvaja, da odvaja"? Đavao.

284
00:18:51,270 --> 00:18:52,890
There's more. Okay, okay. There we go.

285
00:18:52,950 --> 00:18:53,490
Dobro. Više vas.

286
00:18:53,610 --> 00:18:57,630
There we go. Guys, the devil hates marriage.

287
00:18:58,350 --> 00:19:00,270
Ljudi, đavao mrzi brak.

288
00:19:00,450 --> 00:19:02,190
He hates it with a burning passion.

289
00:19:02,670 --> 00:19:05,610
Mrzi ga s gorućom strašću.

290
00:19:06,570 --> 00:19:07,470
Why does he hate it?

291
00:19:07,710 --> 00:19:08,550
Zašto ga mrzi?

292
00:19:08,730 --> 00:19:10,830
Because it represents everything he is not.

293
00:19:11,070 --> 00:19:13,230
Zato što predstavlja sve što on nije.

294
00:19:13,590 --> 00:19:15,870
It represents everything he cannot have.

295
00:19:16,110 --> 00:19:17,910
Predstavlja sve što on ne može imati.

296
00:19:18,090 --> 00:19:22,470
He's literally hellbent on his mission to steal, kill, and destroy us.

297
00:19:22,650 --> 00:19:29,070
On je—u braku je zaustavljen u misiji da uništava, ubije i ukrade.

298
00:19:29,670 --> 00:19:32,850
And in my own marriage, he spent years feeding us these lies.

299
00:19:33,330 --> 00:19:36,570
I u mom braku potrošio je godine hraneći nas tim lažima.

300
00:19:37,230 --> 00:19:39,270
Say things like, "You guys are so different."

301
00:19:39,690 --> 00:19:41,730
Govoreći kao: "Vi ste toliko drugačiji."

302
00:19:42,030 --> 00:19:43,650
I don't know if you're ever going to be happy.

303
00:19:44,130 --> 00:19:46,050
Ne znam hoćete li ikad biti sretni skupa.

304
00:19:46,290 --> 00:19:48,150
Has anything turned out how you expected?

305
00:19:48,270 --> 00:19:50,070
Je li išta bilo kako si očekivao?

306
00:19:50,430 --> 00:19:51,810
Maybe you made the wrong decision.

307
00:19:51,990 --> 00:19:53,370
Možda si donio krivu odluku.

308
00:19:53,910 --> 00:19:55,290
Does this sound familiar to anyone?

309
00:19:55,410 --> 00:19:56,730
Da li vam to zvuči poznato?

310
00:19:58,650 --> 00:20:03,930
Guys, the devil will do everything he can to cast suspicion or insecurity on our marriages.

311
00:20:04,530 --> 00:20:10,890
Đavo će učiniti sve što može da posije strah i sumnju, i odvoj—i razdvojenost u naše brakove.

312
00:20:11,130 --> 00:20:15,810
Because if he can divide us, we find ourselves apart from the very reason why we're made.

313
00:20:16,470 --> 00:20:21,330
I ako nas uspije odvojiti, odvojeni smo od samog smisla za ono što smo stvoreni.

314
00:20:21,750 --> 00:20:24,390
Because we were made for love, for relationship.

315
00:20:24,510 --> 00:20:26,610
Jer smo stvoreni za odnos i za ljubav.

316
00:20:27,270 --> 00:20:30,390
For vulnerable, exposed relationship.

317
00:20:30,810 --> 00:20:33,930
Za ranjiv, otvoren odnos.

318
00:20:34,470 --> 00:20:38,670
I remember when we got married, um, some of our friends wrote us a wedding card.

319
00:20:39,090 --> 00:20:45,390
Sjećam se kad smo se vjenčali, neki od nas prije—naših prijatelji su nam napisali čestitku za vjenčanje.

320
00:20:46,170 --> 00:20:52,290
Inside it said, "If you ever get in an argument, the best thing you can do is just get naked."

321
00:20:53,250 --> 00:20:58,470
I unutra je pisalo: "Ako uđete u svađu, najbolje što možete napraviti je samo se skinuti goli."

322
00:20:58,890 --> 00:21:00,870
Now, I think they were trying to be funny.

323
00:21:01,170 --> 00:21:03,570
Mislim da su pokušali biti šaljivi.

324
00:21:04,050 --> 00:21:09,750
But I want you to think about this. You have the first man, first woman, in the garden, completely exposed.

325
00:21:10,470 --> 00:21:16,710
I želim da razmislite o ovome: imate prvog čovjeka i prvu ženu u raju, potpuno goli, potpuno ogoljeni.

326
00:21:17,250 --> 00:21:18,390
Total self-gift.

327
00:21:18,870 --> 00:21:20,250
Potpuno sebedarije.

328
00:21:20,970 --> 00:21:22,110
Now I want you to look at Jesus.

329
00:21:22,890 --> 00:21:24,330
Želim da pogledate na Isusa.

330
00:21:24,630 --> 00:21:25,710
There we go. On the cross.

331
00:21:25,890 --> 00:21:26,550
Tamo na križu.

332
00:21:27,330 --> 00:21:29,250
Vulnerable, exposed.

333
00:21:29,310 --> 00:21:30,450
Ranjen. Ogoljen.

334
00:21:31,110 --> 00:21:32,010
Total self-gift.

335
00:21:32,310 --> 00:21:33,330
Potpuno sebedarije.

336
00:21:35,190 --> 00:21:38,610
In both our joys and our trials, this is why we're made.

337
00:21:38,850 --> 00:21:41,730
I u našim radostima i poteškoćama, za to smo stvoreni.

338
00:21:42,150 --> 00:21:44,070
To behold and love others.

339
00:21:44,790 --> 00:21:46,770
Da druge volimo i čuvamo.

340
00:21:47,010 --> 00:21:49,170
And to let ourselves be beheld and loved.

341
00:21:49,410 --> 00:21:52,290
I da dopustimo da i mi sami budemo ljubljeni i čuvani.

342
00:21:53,970 --> 00:21:56,130
Catechism 1604 says this.

343
00:21:56,370 --> 00:21:58,950
Katekizam 1604 kaže ovo.

344
00:21:59,670 --> 00:22:03,510
"God, who created man out of love, also calls him to love."

345
00:22:04,170 --> 00:22:08,610
Bog koji je stvorio čovjeka iz ljubavi također ga poziva na ljubav.

346
00:22:09,150 --> 00:22:12,090
The fundamental and innate vocation of every human being.

347
00:22:12,810 --> 00:22:18,510
Uh, temeljni i unutarnji poziv svakog—svakog ljudskog bića.

348
00:22:18,870 --> 00:22:23,190
For man is created in the image and likeness of God, who is himself love.

349
00:22:23,370 --> 00:22:27,630
Jer je Bog stvoren na sliku i priliku Boga koji je sam u sebi ljubav.

350
00:22:28,470 --> 00:22:33,270
And speaking about marriage, it says, "Since God created him man and woman..."

351
00:22:33,330 --> 00:22:38,730
A kada piše o braku, kaže ovako: "Budući da je Bog stvorio čovjeka i ženu..."

352
00:22:39,150 --> 00:22:44,910
Their mutual love becomes an image of the absolute and unfailing love with which God loves man.

353
00:22:45,390 --> 00:22:52,710
Njihova zajednička ljubav postaje slika i prilika apsolutne i nepropadljive ljubavi kojom Bog ljubi čovjeka.

354
00:22:53,250 --> 00:22:56,430
It is good, very good, in the Creator's eyes.

355
00:22:56,730 --> 00:22:59,970
I to je u Stvoriteljevim očima dobro, vrlo dobro.

356
00:23:01,230 --> 00:23:05,430
Now, I'm with Encounter Ministries. Why would I be talking about something like this?

357
00:23:05,730 --> 00:23:11,190
Budući da radim i služim u Encounter Ministries, zašto bih pričao o ovome?

358
00:23:11,310 --> 00:23:14,610
Like, what would this have to do with signs and wonders and evangelization?

359
00:23:14,850 --> 00:23:18,630
Kakve ovo ima veze sa znakovima, čudesima, evangelizacijom?

360
00:23:19,950 --> 00:23:22,170
Well, think about it. How many of you...

361
00:23:22,350 --> 00:23:23,670
Razmislite, koliko vas...

362
00:23:23,850 --> 00:23:25,890
Would like to be really great evangelists?

363
00:23:26,070 --> 00:23:27,990
Bi htjelo biti veliki evangelizatori.

364
00:23:28,710 --> 00:23:32,670
Like, you want people to know how complete and unfailing the love of God is.

365
00:23:32,910 --> 00:23:37,530
Želite da ljudi po vama znaju koliko je velika i nepropadljiva Božja ljubav.

366
00:23:38,430 --> 00:23:42,690
Well, in Scripture, the highest image of how Jesus loves the Church.

367
00:23:42,990 --> 00:23:46,950
U Pismima, najveći—najveća slika kako Krist voli Crkvu.

368
00:23:47,190 --> 00:23:49,950
That shows people that Jesus Christ is alive today.

369
00:23:50,550 --> 00:23:53,610
Koji ljudima pokazuje da je Krist i danas živ.

370
00:23:54,270 --> 00:23:57,510
That shows how he loves us, absolute and unfailing.

371
00:23:57,990 --> 00:24:01,890
Koja pokazuje da nas apsolutno i nemjerljivo voli, ljubi.

372
00:24:02,610 --> 00:24:05,070
Is through the mutual love of a man and a woman in marriage.

373
00:24:05,430 --> 00:24:08,670
Je kroz zajedničku ljubav muškarca i žene u braku.

374
00:24:09,150 --> 00:24:13,770
In Encounter, we say this line: "My vocation is my loudest gospel message."

375
00:24:14,190 --> 00:24:21,510
U Encounteru kažemo da je moje zvanje, moj poziv, najglasnija proklamiranja evanđelja.

376
00:24:21,750 --> 00:24:25,770
Because if someone loves their spouse well, for better or worse...

377
00:24:26,430 --> 00:24:32,910
Jer ako netko voli svog supruga ili supruga u dobrom i u zlu—dobru i zlu...

378
00:24:33,450 --> 00:24:35,250
People want to know, where did that love come from?

379
00:24:35,550 --> 00:24:37,830
Ljudi će se pitati odakle ta ljubav dolazi.

380
00:24:38,370 --> 00:24:39,450
And it brings them to Jesus.

381
00:24:39,810 --> 00:24:40,950
I doveše ih do Isusa.

382
00:24:41,910 --> 00:24:45,570
Now I'll say, on the other hand, if you're proclaiming signs and wonders...

383
00:24:45,990 --> 00:24:49,110
A na drugu ruku, ako pričate o znakovima i čudesima...

384
00:24:49,410 --> 00:24:53,250
Like, you walk into a room and you're like... I'm a prophet.

385
00:24:53,670 --> 00:24:56,010
Uđete u sobu i kažete: "Ja sam prorok."

386
00:24:56,250 --> 00:24:56,910
I'm a healer.

387
00:24:57,510 --> 00:24:58,170
Ja ozdravljam.

388
00:24:58,830 --> 00:25:01,650
But you don't have a lot of love in your marriage.

389
00:25:02,010 --> 00:25:03,810
Ali nemate puno ljubavi u svom braku.

390
00:25:04,830 --> 00:25:09,450
I'm going to say, without the evidence of mutual love in your primary call...

391
00:25:09,750 --> 00:25:13,350
Bez zajedničke ljubavi u primarnom pozivu...

392
00:25:13,830 --> 00:25:18,330
It makes it really hard for someone to trust you to lead them in a missionary call.

393
00:25:18,750 --> 00:25:23,550
Jako teško će vam netko povjeriti svoj život da ga vodite u misionarskom—misijskom pozivu.

394
00:25:23,910 --> 00:25:29,370
Has anyone experienced this? Getting advice from somebody, but you don't see a lot of love in their home?

395
00:25:29,550 --> 00:25:34,770
Je li vam se ikad dogodilo da ste primili savjet od čovjeka za kojeg vidite da nema puno ljubavi u njegovom domu?

396
00:25:35,670 --> 00:25:39,450
This is why someone from Encounter Ministries is sharing this message.

397
00:25:39,930 --> 00:25:42,750
Zato iz Encounter Ministries pričamo o ovome.

398
00:25:42,990 --> 00:25:47,310
Because if you're inspired to take down the kingdom of darkness, start in your marriage.

399
00:25:47,610 --> 00:25:54,690
Jer ako imate poziv i osjećate poziv da se trebate boriti protiv kraljevstva tame, morate početi u vlastitom braku.

400
00:25:54,990 --> 00:25:59,130
Because if you're in ministry, that's the number one place the enemy targets.

401
00:25:59,370 --> 00:26:03,870
Jer ako ste u službi i služite, to je prvo mjesto na koje đavao napada.

402
00:26:04,170 --> 00:26:08,370
And if you can rid your marriage to footholds to the enemy, you're going to be unstoppable.

403
00:26:08,490 --> 00:26:14,070
I ako možete pripremiti vaš brak da ne pada pod naletima đavla, bit ćete nezaustavljivi.

404
00:26:14,790 --> 00:26:16,710
Cardinal Raymond Burke once said this.

405
00:26:17,010 --> 00:26:19,230
Kardinal Raymond Burke je jednom ovo rekao.

406
00:26:19,710 --> 00:26:25,650
He said, "There's no greater force against evil in the world than the love of a man and woman in marriage."

407
00:26:25,770 --> 00:26:30,690
Ne postoji jača sila protiv zla u svijetu od ljubavi muškarca i žene u braku.

408
00:26:31,530 --> 00:26:35,550
So do you guys want to go through keys to activate that kind of love in your marriages?

409
00:26:35,790 --> 00:26:39,270
Želite li proći kroz ključeve kako aktivirati takvu ljubav u svom braku?

410
00:26:39,810 --> 00:26:40,650
Are you open to that?

411
00:26:40,830 --> 00:26:41,790
Jeste otvoreni za to?

412
00:26:41,790 --> 00:26:43,290
Or to learn them for somebody you love?

413
00:26:43,710 --> 00:26:46,950
Ili da ih naučite za nekoga koga znate i koga ljubite?

414
00:26:47,190 --> 00:26:48,570
You guys don't sound very excited.

415
00:26:48,810 --> 00:26:50,490
Ne zvučite previše uzbuđeno.

416
00:26:50,970 --> 00:26:52,590
Are you ready to go through some keys?

417
00:26:52,830 --> 00:26:53,370
Jeste spremni?

418
00:26:53,370 --> 00:26:58,230
Do you want keys? I heard you guys have a lot of tools. I'm giving you tools.

419
00:26:58,590 --> 00:27:01,170
Čuo sam da volite puno alata i dajem vam alate.

420
00:27:01,770 --> 00:27:04,110
All right, let's take a deep breath in.

421
00:27:04,950 --> 00:27:05,490
Udahnite.

422
00:27:06,210 --> 00:27:06,870
Deep breath out.

423
00:27:07,950 --> 00:27:08,490
Izdahnite.

424
00:27:08,850 --> 00:27:09,630
Come, Holy Spirit.

425
00:27:10,050 --> 00:27:11,010
Dođi, Duše Sveti.

426
00:27:11,550 --> 00:27:17,130
So I believe the best—the best advice of how to love is right in Scripture.

427
00:27:17,490 --> 00:27:20,790
Vjerujem da je najbolji savjet kako ljubiti u Pismima, u Svetom Pismu.

428
00:27:21,150 --> 00:27:22,470
1 Corinthians 13.

429
00:27:22,830 --> 00:27:24,270
1. Korinćanima 13.

430
00:27:24,690 --> 00:27:27,930
For many of you, this may have been Redditor wedding or a friend's wedding.

431
00:27:28,350 --> 00:27:32,550
Za mnoge od vas, čuli ste to bar na svom vjenčanju ili vjenčanju svojih prijatelja.

432
00:27:33,150 --> 00:27:38,550
But I want to let you use this as a—as a litmus test to see where your marriage is at today.

433
00:27:38,910 --> 00:27:43,470
A ovo ću vam dati sad kao jedan ispit savjesti: gdje je vaš brak danas?

434
00:27:44,070 --> 00:27:45,210
I'll read it out for you first.

435
00:27:45,510 --> 00:27:46,710
Prvo ću pročitati za vas.

436
00:27:47,310 --> 00:27:48,090
Love is patient.

437
00:27:49,050 --> 00:27:50,610
Ljubav je—ljubav je strpljiva.

438
00:27:50,790 --> 00:27:51,570
Love is kind.

439
00:27:52,050 --> 00:27:53,370
Ljubav je blaga.

440
00:27:53,730 --> 00:27:54,570
It is not jealous.

441
00:27:55,110 --> 00:27:55,950
Nije ljubomorna.

442
00:27:56,190 --> 00:27:57,090
It is not pompous.

443
00:27:58,050 --> 00:28:05,250
Ne nadima se. Free translation doesn't work.

444
00:28:08,550 --> 00:28:10,530
Actually, you—you go ahead and just read it.

445
00:28:12,390 --> 00:28:13,050
Let you start.

446
00:28:13,350 --> 00:28:15,810
You can just start from the beginning. 1 Corinthians 13.

447
00:28:18,270 --> 00:28:18,930
Oh, what verse?

448
00:28:19,290 --> 00:28:20,130
4. Four.

449
00:28:21,090 --> 00:28:21,630
Till 7.

450
00:28:21,750 --> 00:28:22,350
4 to 7.

451
00:28:22,890 --> 00:28:36,090
Ljubav je velikodušna, dobrostiva je ljubav, ne zavidi. Ljubav se ne hvasta, ne nadima se. Nije nepristojna, ne traži svoje. Nije razdražljiva, ne pamti zlo.

452
00:28:36,750 --> 00:28:45,150
Ne raduje se nepravdi, a raduje se istini. Sve pokriva, sve vjeruje, svemu se nada, sve podnosi.

453
00:28:46,290 --> 00:28:48,870
I'm sorry for any Americans in the room that didn't understand that.

454
00:28:49,290 --> 00:28:52,110
Ispričavam se svim Amerikancima u sobi koji nisu razumjeli.

455
00:28:52,830 --> 00:28:56,550
Now listen. If God is love and I'm made in his image and likeness...

456
00:28:56,730 --> 00:28:59,730
Ako je Bog ljubav, i stvoren sam na njegovu sliku i priliku.

457
00:29:00,270 --> 00:29:02,910
These characteristics should describe me. Amen?

458
00:29:03,150 --> 00:29:05,970
Ove karakteristike bi trebale im opisivati mene.

459
00:29:06,630 --> 00:29:10,230
So as I go through these, and I'm going to group these into six main areas...

460
00:29:10,470 --> 00:29:14,370
I ove ću grupirati u šest grupa, ove karakteristike.

461
00:29:14,550 --> 00:29:18,390
I want to invite you to declare these attributes of love over yourself.

462
00:29:18,870 --> 00:29:24,750
Želim da ih proklamirate na svojim životima, ove atribute, ove karakteristike.

463
00:29:24,930 --> 00:29:28,470
And I want you to pay attention to the ones that feel off for you.

464
00:29:28,650 --> 00:29:33,510
I želim da pazite na one za koje mislite da nisu dio vas, da nisu vaša karakteristika.

465
00:29:33,690 --> 00:29:36,450
Because that's likely an area that Holy Spirit wants to work.

466
00:29:36,570 --> 00:29:39,810
Jer to je vjerojatno područje na kojem vas Duh Sveti poziva da radite.

467
00:29:40,830 --> 00:29:42,510
Number 1: love is patient.

468
00:29:42,870 --> 00:29:46,830
Broj 1: ljubav je velikodušna, strpljiva.

469
00:29:50,610 --> 00:29:55,950
So, because he's translating, let's—I want you to repeat after him. Understood?

470
00:29:55,950 --> 00:29:57,030
Želim da ponavljate za mnom.

471
00:29:57,750 --> 00:29:57,930
Okay.

472
00:29:58,950 --> 00:29:59,310
Hvala.

473
00:30:00,090 --> 00:30:02,370
Whatever he says. Sorry if it's not right.

474
00:30:02,610 --> 00:30:05,850
Što god on kaže, ispričavamo se ako nije u redu, ako nije točno.

475
00:30:06,150 --> 00:30:09,510
So go ahead and declare this out loud: "I am patient."

476
00:30:10,170 --> 00:30:11,250
Ja sam strpljiv.

477
00:30:13,770 --> 00:30:16,230
Just close your eyes and just take a moment to see how that feels.

478
00:30:16,410 --> 00:30:19,650
Zatvorite oči i pogledajte kako vam se to čini.

479
00:30:20,550 --> 00:30:21,390
I am patient.

480
00:30:22,170 --> 00:30:24,330
Ja sam strpljiv. Strpljiva.

481
00:30:30,870 --> 00:30:38,190
Now let me be clear with this. Patience isn't waiting a really, really, really long time, and then love is in your home.

482
00:30:38,910 --> 00:30:47,790
Samo da naglasim, strpljenje nije da dugo, dugo, dugo, dugo nešto čekate i onda odjedanput ljubav se pojavi u vašem domu.

483
00:30:48,270 --> 00:30:51,030
Patience has everything to do with your posture.

484
00:30:52,470 --> 00:30:55,050
Strpljivost je vezana za vaš stav.

485
00:30:55,770 --> 00:30:57,750
Have you guys heard of the Five Love Languages?

486
00:30:57,870 --> 00:30:59,490
Jeste čuli za Pet jezika ljubavi?

487
00:30:59,670 --> 00:31:04,350
Yeah. It's a—it's a framework by Dr. Gary Chapman that came out in the '90s.

488
00:31:04,770 --> 00:31:08,010
Dr. Gary Chapman je izašao s tom knjigom 90-ih.

489
00:31:08,190 --> 00:31:12,030
And it outlines five distinct ways that people give and receive love.

490
00:31:12,210 --> 00:31:16,110
I naglašava pet različitih načina na koji ljudi primaju i daju ljubav.

491
00:31:16,290 --> 00:31:17,610
So there's words of affirmation.

492
00:31:18,330 --> 00:31:19,110
Riječ potvrde.

493
00:31:19,590 --> 00:31:20,370
Quality time.

494
00:31:20,850 --> 00:31:22,530
Kvalitetno vrijeme provedeno zajedno.

495
00:31:22,650 --> 00:31:23,490
Physical touch.

496
00:31:24,030 --> 00:31:24,750
Fizički dodir.

497
00:31:25,110 --> 00:31:25,890
Acts of service.

498
00:31:26,970 --> 00:31:28,710
Djela ljubavi i služenja.

499
00:31:29,070 --> 00:31:29,910
And receiving gifts.

500
00:31:30,270 --> 00:31:31,350
I primanje darova.

501
00:31:31,950 --> 00:31:35,430
Well, I read studies about these love languages over the last few years.

502
00:31:35,670 --> 00:31:38,010
Pročitao sam nekoliko studija o

503
00:31:39,210 --> 00:31:41,130
jezicima ljubavi kroz zadnjih nekoliko godina.

504
00:31:41,670 --> 00:31:43,710
Can anyone guess what the top love language is?

505
00:31:44,070 --> 00:31:47,250
Može li netko pogoditi koji je glavni, najčešći jezik ljubavi?

506
00:31:50,730 --> 00:31:54,630
Both. Both, actually. He said touch. Anyone else?

507
00:31:55,710 --> 00:31:56,310
Quality time.

508
00:31:56,430 --> 00:31:57,750
There it is. It's quality time.

509
00:31:59,670 --> 00:32:01,290
Kvalitetno vrijeme provedeno zajedno.

510
00:32:01,770 --> 00:32:02,670
Now, why is that?

511
00:32:02,850 --> 00:32:03,690
Zašto je to tako?

512
00:32:04,050 --> 00:32:07,350
Well, at least for Americans, we have a culture of go, go, go.

513
00:32:07,590 --> 00:32:10,590
Bar za nas Amerikance imamo kulturu: samo dalje, dalje, dalje.

514
00:32:11,670 --> 00:32:17,130
And have you ever considered why maybe we don't feel the love in marriage is because we're not showing up?

515
00:32:17,610 --> 00:32:23,310
Jeste li možda razmislili da često ne osjećamo ljubav u braku zato što se ne pojavljujemo u braku?

516
00:32:23,370 --> 00:32:24,690
And I mean really showing up.

517
00:32:24,810 --> 00:32:26,430
I mislim da se stvarno pojavimo.

518
00:32:27,390 --> 00:32:29,490
Scrolling on opposite sides of the couch.

519
00:32:29,550 --> 00:32:29,850
Scrolling.

520
00:32:30,210 --> 00:32:31,050
Is not quality time.

521
00:32:31,410 --> 00:32:35,070
Na različitim dijelovima kauča nije kvalitetno vrijeme provedeno zajedno.

522
00:32:35,490 --> 00:32:40,650
And I'd also say this: working together on something isn't the fulfillment of quality time either.

523
00:32:40,890 --> 00:32:45,270
I čak i to da radimo nešto zajedno nije provođenje kvalitetnog vremena zajedno.

524
00:32:45,630 --> 00:32:51,210
I've heard this—this quote from a French author used many times to describe marriage.

525
00:32:51,690 --> 00:32:56,070
Čuo sam ovu izjavu jednog francuskog autora koja opisuje brak.

526
00:32:56,970 --> 00:33:00,690
That love doesn't consist of gazing at each other.

527
00:33:01,290 --> 00:33:05,130
Ljubav nije—ljubav se ne sastoji u tome da gledamo jedno u drugo.

528
00:33:05,490 --> 00:33:07,950
But in looking outward together in the same direction.

529
00:33:08,070 --> 00:33:11,430
Nego da zajedno gledamo vani u istom smjeru.

530
00:33:11,670 --> 00:33:13,530
Has anyone heard this in the context of marriage?

531
00:33:13,590 --> 00:33:15,330
Je li netko to čuo u kontekstu braka?

532
00:33:15,510 --> 00:33:16,590
Yeah. It sounds great.

533
00:33:17,550 --> 00:33:18,270
Zvuči odlično.

534
00:33:18,930 --> 00:33:22,650
There's this—this semblance of unity and teamwork.

535
00:33:22,830 --> 00:33:26,970
Ovaj—taj osjećaj zajedništva i jedinstva i timskog rada.

536
00:33:27,270 --> 00:33:32,970
And I love that. I—as you remember, I wanted my wife to join me in everything, working together.

537
00:33:33,210 --> 00:33:37,530
Sviđa mi se to. I htio sam da mi se moja supruga pridruži u tome da sve zajedno radimo.

538
00:33:37,890 --> 00:33:39,210
But there's a problem with this.

539
00:33:39,390 --> 00:33:40,650
Ali postoji problem s time.

540
00:33:40,890 --> 00:33:45,510
Because if this is the focus, your love is always being directed outward.

541
00:33:45,990 --> 00:33:49,650
Jer ako je to tvoj fokus, tvoja ljubav je uvijek usmjerena na van.

542
00:33:50,070 --> 00:33:53,910
And true or false, your spouse needs to receive your love.

543
00:33:54,510 --> 00:34:00,750
I bilo to istinito ili ne, tvoj supružnik, tvoja supruga trebaju primiti tvoju ljubav.

544
00:34:02,250 --> 00:34:02,550
Da.

545
00:34:03,570 --> 00:34:03,750
Da.

546
00:34:05,070 --> 00:34:08,190
Now, charity—this looking outward—it's very important.

547
00:34:08,670 --> 00:34:11,490
I ta ljubav koja se daje na van je jako potrebna.

548
00:34:11,910 --> 00:34:16,050
But true quality time in marriage, you have to behold the other.

549
00:34:16,650 --> 00:34:21,930
I da bi proveli zajedno vrijeme kvalitetno skupa, morate paziti jedno na drugo.

550
00:34:22,110 --> 00:34:23,250
You have to see the other.

551
00:34:23,490 --> 00:34:24,810
Morate vidjeti drugog.

552
00:34:25,350 --> 00:34:33,030
And I'd argue that quality time, in terms of quality, is going to be measured by how much your spouse experiences being seen.

553
00:34:33,870 --> 00:34:44,070
I vjerujem da će se kvaliteta—i ta kvaliteta u toj riječi—ugledavati u tome koliko se supruga ili suprug osjećalo viđenim i shvaćenim.

554
00:34:44,430 --> 00:34:49,050
By them first and regularly being the direct recipient of your love.

555
00:34:49,290 --> 00:34:53,070
Da oni prvi direktno budu primatelji tvoje ljubavi.

556
00:34:53,730 --> 00:34:58,050
In Encounter, we have this saying that all fruitful ministry flows out of identity.

557
00:34:58,830 --> 00:35:03,090
U Encounteru kažemo da svako plodno djelovanje i služenje

558
00:35:04,350 --> 00:35:05,970
proizlazi iz identiteta.

559
00:35:06,390 --> 00:35:11,190
And that means before we teach anyone to prophesy or heal the sick...

560
00:35:11,430 --> 00:35:15,990
I prije nego što bilo koga učimo da prorokuje ili ozdravlja bolesne.

561
00:35:16,470 --> 00:35:23,370
They spend an entire quarter talking with God, experiencing being seen, being known first.

562
00:35:23,730 --> 00:35:30,810
Provode cijeli semestar prvo upoznavajući Boga i da Bog—da spoznaju da i Bog vidi i poznaje njih.

563
00:35:31,050 --> 00:35:38,010
And then out of that place, we equip them to heal the sick, to raise the dead, and all the other amazing things.

564
00:35:38,190 --> 00:35:44,190
I onda ih iz tog mjesta opremamo da liječe bolesne, uskrisuju mrtve i sve ostale prekrasne stvari.

565
00:35:44,670 --> 00:35:46,830
Our marriages are called to do the same.

566
00:35:47,190 --> 00:35:50,130
I isto se—isto vrijedi i za naše brakove.

567
00:35:50,550 --> 00:35:52,530
We love because he first loved us.

568
00:35:52,830 --> 00:35:54,750
Mi ljubimo zato što je on nas prvi ljubio.

569
00:35:57,870 --> 00:36:00,270
In the Old Testament, in Deuteronomy, it says this.

570
00:36:01,350 --> 00:36:04,950
U Knjizi Ponovljenog zakona u Starom zavjetu kaže ovako.

571
00:36:05,850 --> 00:36:08,310
If you want to look it up: Deuteronomy 24:5.

572
00:36:13,290 --> 00:36:29,610
While you're looking it up, I'll read it out. It says—24:5—says, "When a man is newly wed, he shall not go out on a military expedition, nor shall any duty be imposed on him.

573
00:36:29,670 --> 00:36:36,330
He shall be exempt for one year for the sake of his family, to bring joy to the wife he has married."

574
00:36:44,970 --> 00:36:46,290
That's not it. Sorry.

575
00:36:46,470 --> 00:36:48,510
Chapter 24, verse 5. Deuteronomy.

576
00:36:54,330 --> 00:36:55,050
24:5.

577
00:36:55,230 --> 00:36:55,410
Yes.

578
00:36:55,650 --> 00:37:04,410
Kad se tko ne to može ni neka ne ide u vojsku, neka mu se ne dodjeljuje nikakva služba, nego oslobođen neka ostane kod kuće godinu dana da razveseljuje ženu koju je doveo.

579
00:37:05,430 --> 00:37:05,610
Yeah.

580
00:37:05,730 --> 00:37:05,910
Yes.

581
00:37:06,270 --> 00:37:07,110
Have you guys heard this?

582
00:37:07,290 --> 00:37:08,370
Jeste li to ikada čuli?

583
00:37:08,430 --> 00:37:11,430
You heard this. Okay. I missed this in my Bible reading.

584
00:37:11,910 --> 00:37:14,070
Ja sam ovo propustio u svom čitanju Biblije.

585
00:37:14,490 --> 00:37:23,310
Can you imagine what our marriages would look like if we took an entire year from the beginning of marriage just to pour joy into our spouse?

586
00:37:23,790 --> 00:37:30,630
Zamislite kako bi izgledali naši brakovi da uzmemo punu godinu dana da samo razveseljujemo svoju suprugu ili supruga.

587
00:37:30,930 --> 00:37:31,770
And did I do that?

588
00:37:31,950 --> 00:37:33,030
Jesam li ja to učinio?

589
00:37:33,210 --> 00:37:33,810
Of course not.

590
00:37:34,050 --> 00:37:34,830
Naravno da nisam.

591
00:37:35,730 --> 00:37:38,130
No. To prove I was a worthy husband.

592
00:37:38,250 --> 00:37:40,350
Da bih dokazao da sam vrijedan muž.

593
00:37:40,470 --> 00:37:42,390
I got preoccupied with staying busy.

594
00:37:43,170 --> 00:37:45,690
Preokupirao sam se time da sam bio zaposlen.

595
00:37:45,870 --> 00:37:48,390
I took a promotion. I took longer hours at work.

596
00:37:48,570 --> 00:37:53,310
Radio sam prekovremene na poslu, prihvatio sam promaknuće.

597
00:37:53,610 --> 00:37:56,010
We bought a house. I was buying things for the house.

598
00:37:56,250 --> 00:37:58,530
Kupio sam kuću, kupovali smo stvari za kuću.

599
00:37:58,950 --> 00:38:01,170
Getting a puppy and regretting getting a puppy.

600
00:38:01,470 --> 00:38:04,350
Uzeli smo psa, pa onda smo zažalili što smo uzeli psa.

601
00:38:05,610 --> 00:38:09,390
And somehow I found a way to get right back into leading ministry.

602
00:38:09,630 --> 00:38:12,510
I nekako sam se vratio nazad tome da vodim službu.

603
00:38:12,750 --> 00:38:14,730
And this became a huge source of tension.

604
00:38:14,970 --> 00:38:17,250
I to je postao veliki izvor napetosti.

605
00:38:17,370 --> 00:38:19,530
Because as I invested in ministry...

606
00:38:19,890 --> 00:38:21,630
Jer kako sam ulagao u služenje...

607
00:38:21,990 --> 00:38:23,190
It was bearing a lot of fruit.

608
00:38:23,670 --> 00:38:25,050
Donosilo je jako puno ploda.

609
00:38:25,290 --> 00:38:27,330
So what did I do? I poured more into it.

610
00:38:27,510 --> 00:38:29,790
I što sam napravio? Još sam više počeo služiti.

611
00:38:30,030 --> 00:38:33,990
And then I'm telling my wife, "Why are you so sad? You should be doing this."

612
00:38:34,110 --> 00:38:37,470
I onda govorim svojoj ženi: "Zašto si tako tužna? I ti bi trebala služiti."

613
00:38:37,770 --> 00:38:40,770
And what I wasn't realizing was that she needed ministry herself.

614
00:38:41,010 --> 00:38:43,890
A ono što nisam shvatio je da je i njoj bilo potrebno služenje.

615
00:38:44,130 --> 00:38:47,370
She needed love and attention from those that were closest to her.

616
00:38:47,970 --> 00:38:51,390
Bila joj je potrebna ljubav i pažnja od onih koji su joj bili najbliži.

617
00:38:51,750 --> 00:38:55,590
And she needed patient love, the kind that could just be with her when she felt lost.

618
00:38:55,710 --> 00:39:01,950
Trebala joj je strpljiva ljubav koja je mogla biti s njom u onim trenucima kada se osjećala izgubljeno.

619
00:39:02,610 --> 00:39:05,010
Now, honestly, that's not my go-to.

620
00:39:05,550 --> 00:39:08,910
Iskreno, to nije način na koji ja volim davati ljubav.

621
00:39:09,450 --> 00:39:13,590
I like to problem-solve. I like to take risks, go and try things out.

622
00:39:13,710 --> 00:39:16,710
Ja volim riskirati, isprobavati stvari, rješavati probleme.

623
00:39:17,250 --> 00:39:21,030
In the United States, we have this thing called a Strength Finders assessment.

624
00:39:21,270 --> 00:39:25,470
U SAD-u imamo testove gdje pronalazite svoje jake strane.

625
00:39:25,950 --> 00:39:30,870
My top strength is Activator, with this tagline: "Is often impatient."

626
00:39:31,590 --> 00:39:36,630
Moja—moj naziv bi bio Aktivator, onaj koji je često nestrpljiv.

627
00:39:37,530 --> 00:39:40,650
We also have another that's called the Working Genius assessment.

628
00:39:40,890 --> 00:39:44,970
Onda imamo drugu koja se kaže Working Genius, ono, radni genij.

629
00:39:45,210 --> 00:39:47,370
I have Tenacity and Galvanizing.

630
00:39:48,030 --> 00:39:55,530
Imam... Rješavanje problema i motiviranje.

631
00:39:56,910 --> 00:40:09,270
Can we give him a hand? He's doing great. I'll translate. It means, "I'm eager to get things moving and to get you moving with me."

632
00:40:09,690 --> 00:40:15,210
Prevest ću: "Jako sam založen da se pokrenu stvari i da se vi pokrenete sa mnom."

633
00:40:15,390 --> 00:40:19,890
And if someone's not ready to move, I would just move to those that are.

634
00:40:20,250 --> 00:40:24,030
I ako netko nije spreman pokrenuti se, otišao bi onima koji jesu spremni.

635
00:40:24,510 --> 00:40:31,410
Now, in ministry, that can be really great. Those are—those are signs of, like, an evangelist or what we call a harvester.

636
00:40:32,070 --> 00:40:38,910
To u evangelizaciji može biti dobro. To su znakovi evangelizatora ili onoga koji ide i kupi—koji sije puno plodova.

637
00:40:39,150 --> 00:40:40,650
And the church does need more of these.

638
00:40:40,890 --> 00:40:42,510
I crkvi je potrebno takvih ljudi.

639
00:40:43,230 --> 00:40:47,250
But in marriage, you can't just move on to someone else who's ready.

640
00:40:47,730 --> 00:40:51,090
Ali u braku ne možeš otići do nekog drugog koji je spreman.

641
00:40:51,750 --> 00:40:54,810
So I started spending more time in outside ministry.

642
00:40:55,050 --> 00:40:58,350
Počeo sam provoditi više vremena vani u služenju.

643
00:40:59,850 --> 00:41:03,150
And as I was succeeding as a professional minister...

644
00:41:03,390 --> 00:41:07,530
I kako sam uspijevao u tome da sam—da profesionalno služim drugima.

645
00:41:07,890 --> 00:41:13,530
I was cultivating an environment for deeper wounds of rejection and abandonment with my wife.

646
00:41:13,830 --> 00:41:22,410
Kultivirao sam atmosferu u kojoj se moja žena još dublje ulazila u ranu odbačenosti i...

647
00:41:23,730 --> 00:41:24,510
Of rejection and...

648
00:41:24,630 --> 00:41:26,670
Abandonment. I ostavljenosti, napuštenosti.

649
00:41:26,850 --> 00:41:33,570
Yeah. And the environment I cultivated was influenced by everything that I did outside of the home.

650
00:41:33,690 --> 00:41:38,670
I to okruženje se povećavalo sa svime onime što sam radio izvan kuće.

651
00:41:39,030 --> 00:41:41,970
Communicating this: we move at a fast pace.

652
00:41:42,810 --> 00:41:45,930
Kad sam komunicirao, mi idemo brzim tempom.

653
00:41:47,490 --> 00:41:54,570
And time with my wife was often spent diagnosing: "How can we fix you and catch you up to speed?"

654
00:41:55,230 --> 00:42:03,690
I često sam komunicirao sa ženom na način da sam joj govorio kako možemo riješiti tvoje probleme i dovesti te u ovaj brzi tempo.

655
00:42:04,230 --> 00:42:07,290
How many of you went to Medjugorje with the JP TOOR Healing Center recently?

656
00:42:07,470 --> 00:42:09,510
Koliko od vas je bilo u Međugorju na

657
00:42:10,830 --> 00:42:14,610
susretu sa John Paul II za unutarnje ozdravljenje?

658
00:42:15,330 --> 00:42:16,050
A few of you. Okay.

659
00:42:16,110 --> 00:42:16,770
Od Bob Schutza?

660
00:42:17,250 --> 00:42:18,390
Bob Schutz. There you go.

661
00:42:20,310 --> 00:42:21,030
Prilično slično.

662
00:42:21,330 --> 00:42:25,710
Yes. Sister Miriam often says this powerful line.

663
00:42:25,950 --> 00:42:28,950
Sestra Miriam kaže često ovu snažnu rečenicu.

664
00:42:29,250 --> 00:42:32,970
She says, "You are not a problem to be fixed; you are a person to be loved."

665
00:42:33,450 --> 00:42:38,190
Ti nisi problem koji treba popraviti, nego osoba koju treba ljubiti.

666
00:42:38,610 --> 00:42:41,250
The first time I heard this, it cut me to the heart.

667
00:42:41,490 --> 00:42:44,070
Prvi put kad sam to čuo, pogodilo me ravno u srce.

668
00:42:44,250 --> 00:42:46,530
Because that's exactly how I'd been treating my wife.

669
00:42:46,770 --> 00:42:50,490
Jer to je baš bio način na koji sam se ja postavljao prema svojoj ženi.

670
00:42:51,030 --> 00:42:52,050
You ready for another one?

671
00:42:52,350 --> 00:42:53,490
Jeste spremni za još jednu?

672
00:42:53,970 --> 00:42:58,590
Saint Vincent de Paul says, "The one who hurries delays the things of God."

673
00:42:58,830 --> 00:43:04,050
Sveti Vincent Paulski kaže: "Onaj tko žuri, odgađa Božje stvari."

674
00:43:05,130 --> 00:43:10,230
So six years into our marriage, when we hit a crisis and had no idea how to fix our marriage...

675
00:43:10,590 --> 00:43:18,630
Nakon 6 godina braka, kad smo došli do velike krize, nismo znali kako popraviti naš brak.

676
00:43:19,410 --> 00:43:22,650
I felt Holy Spirit telling me, "Kevin, just show up."

677
00:43:22,950 --> 00:43:26,850
Osjetio sam da me Duh Sveti poziva da se samo pojavim, da budem prisutan.

678
00:43:27,270 --> 00:43:30,930
Don't have an agenda, no distractions, just be.

679
00:43:31,470 --> 00:43:34,950
Nemoj imati planove, nemoj imati akcije, samo budi.

680
00:43:35,910 --> 00:43:38,490
I'm like, okay, how do I do that?

681
00:43:39,030 --> 00:43:41,010
U redu. Kako da to napravim?

682
00:43:42,270 --> 00:43:45,630
Well, I got in this habit of every night, after the kids are in bed...

683
00:43:46,590 --> 00:43:50,730
Uzeo sam ovu naviku da kad su—kad djeca legnu spavati u krevet...

684
00:43:51,330 --> 00:43:56,430
I would just go to the couch without my phone, without the TV on, no distractions.

685
00:43:56,850 --> 00:44:00,930
Sjeo bih na kauč, bez telefona, bez upaljenog TV-a, bez distrakcija.

686
00:44:01,170 --> 00:44:03,390
And I would just wait, still.

687
00:44:03,510 --> 00:44:04,830
I samo bih mirno čekao.

688
00:44:05,550 --> 00:44:06,690
Like a crazy person.

689
00:44:07,050 --> 00:44:07,770
Kao neki luđak.

690
00:44:09,330 --> 00:44:13,770
And if my wife wanted to come join me, she could. If not, I would just stay there and pray.

691
00:44:14,310 --> 00:44:20,070
I ako se moja žena htjela doći pridružiti mi se, super. Ako ne, ostao bih tamo i molio.

692
00:44:21,030 --> 00:44:25,770
And I would talk to the Lord, but I was posturing myself to be interrupted at any moment.

693
00:44:27,270 --> 00:44:32,130
Razgovarao sam s Bogom, ali sam se postavljao tako da mi se u bilo kojem trenutku može prekinuti.

694
00:44:32,670 --> 00:44:34,590
Because you can't force quality time.

695
00:44:34,710 --> 00:44:38,130
Jer ne možeš natjerati i isforsirati kvalitetno vrijeme.

696
00:44:38,430 --> 00:44:40,770
But you can posture yourself for receptivity.

697
00:44:41,070 --> 00:44:43,470
Ali možeš se postaviti tako da ga možeš primiti.

698
00:44:44,130 --> 00:44:48,450
And if you do this, you're essentially meeting your spouse at their level, at their pace.

699
00:44:48,930 --> 00:44:57,870
I ako se tako postaviš, postavljaš se da možeš svog supružnika ili suprugu dočekati na njihovoj razini i u njihovom tempu.

700
00:44:58,290 --> 00:45:03,030
It's like a three-legged race. You have to sync your pace with the other.

701
00:45:03,090 --> 00:45:09,630
To je kao kad se utrkujete s tri noge, ono, jedna noga vam je zavezana, zajednička. Morate se uskladiti u brzini.

702
00:45:10,710 --> 00:45:16,050
Something that's really interesting: there's psychological studies of something called heart sync.

703
00:45:17,430 --> 00:45:23,790
Postoje istraživanja, psihološka, koja govore o sinkronizaciji srca.

704
00:45:24,870 --> 00:45:31,170
Out of Princeton University, there was this study that said, "When people are emotionally attuned..."

705
00:45:32,010 --> 00:45:34,290
U trenutku... na Princetonu su istraživali kad su

706
00:45:35,610 --> 00:45:42,750
ljudi emocionalno nisu spojivi, nisu spojeni, nisu se našli.

707
00:45:42,990 --> 00:45:45,690
And they're engaged in back-and-forth discussion.

708
00:45:46,230 --> 00:45:49,530
I cijelo vrijeme su uključeni u nekakve rasprave i diskusije.

709
00:45:50,250 --> 00:45:53,310
Their heart rates physically synchronize.

710
00:45:53,490 --> 00:45:56,610
Njihova se srca fizički sinkroniziraju.

711
00:45:57,150 --> 00:46:04,590
And when their hearts physically synchronize, the study showed they were 70% more likely to share joint decision-making.

712
00:46:04,830 --> 00:46:11,670
I u trenutku kad se njihova srca sinkroniziraju, 70% je veća šansa da dođu do zajedničke odluke.

713
00:46:12,990 --> 00:46:14,010
Isn't that awesome?

714
00:46:14,370 --> 00:46:15,330
Zar to nije zanimljivo?

715
00:46:15,750 --> 00:46:21,210
Like, scientifically, it shows us: if you want agreement in your marriage, you have to sync your pace.

716
00:46:21,810 --> 00:46:28,170
Ako želite doći do zajedničkog rješenja u braku, morate doći do zajedničke brzine, zajedničkog tempa.

717
00:46:28,350 --> 00:46:29,490
And meet them at their level.

718
00:46:30,150 --> 00:46:34,590
I doći do zajedničkog tempa svog supružnika.

719
00:46:34,890 --> 00:46:42,090
Now, for those of you in ministry, if their level is slower than the pace of your ministry...

720
00:46:42,270 --> 00:46:48,030
Za vas koji služite, ako je tempo vašeg supružnika sporiji od vaše službe...

721
00:46:48,390 --> 00:46:51,450
That means you either have to slow down or step away.

722
00:46:51,810 --> 00:46:56,190
To znači: ili morate usporiti, ili morate odstupiti sa svog mjesta.

723
00:46:56,790 --> 00:47:02,790
One of the things my wife told me when she was feeling really hurt was, "Kevin, you love the ministry more than me."

724
00:47:03,030 --> 00:47:09,690
U jednom trenutku moja žena mi je rekla: "Kevine, voliš više svoju službu nego što voliš mene."

725
00:47:10,050 --> 00:47:12,390
Now, I personally knew that wasn't true.

726
00:47:12,750 --> 00:47:14,070
Ja sam znao da to nije istina.

727
00:47:14,430 --> 00:47:18,870
But if she's believing that and telling me that, it shows me we are way out of sync.

728
00:47:19,650 --> 00:47:25,770
I ako ona u to vjeruje i to mi govori, znači da smo mi jako daleko od toga da budemo sinkronizirani.

729
00:47:26,070 --> 00:47:32,790
I remember I brought that to my spiritual director, and his response was, "Kevin, I think you need to let go of the ministry."

730
00:47:33,210 --> 00:47:39,210
Kad sam to rekao svom duhovniku, on mi je rekao: "Kevine, mislim da moraš napustiti službu."

731
00:47:39,450 --> 00:47:40,290
And I said, "Yeah?"

732
00:47:40,830 --> 00:47:41,970
Pitao sam se: "Stvarno?"

733
00:47:43,410 --> 00:47:46,770
And over the years, I'd been building a ministry team.

734
00:47:46,950 --> 00:47:50,070
A kroz godine sam izgrađivao tim s kojim smo služili.

735
00:47:50,370 --> 00:47:54,630
I had hundreds of people coming every week, with 35 to 40 volunteers helping me.

736
00:47:54,870 --> 00:48:01,590
Imali smo stotine ljudi koji su dolazili svakog tjedna, i 35 do 40 ljudi koji su zajedno sa mnom služili.

737
00:48:01,890 --> 00:48:04,050
And no one willing to step up and lead.

738
00:48:04,650 --> 00:48:06,690
Nitko nije želio preuzeti vodeću ulogu.

739
00:48:07,530 --> 00:48:09,690
But I sent a resignation email the next day.

740
00:48:09,930 --> 00:48:13,650
Ali idućeg dana sam poslao email sa svojom ostavkom.

741
00:48:13,950 --> 00:48:16,350
And I honestly didn't know if I'd ever be in ministry again.

742
00:48:16,830 --> 00:48:19,530
I nisam bio siguran da li ću se ikad više vratiti služenju.

743
00:48:19,890 --> 00:48:22,830
But after I sent that email, that's when I started coming to the couch.

744
00:48:23,430 --> 00:48:27,030
Ali kad sam poslao taj email, taj dan sam počeo se pojavljivati na kauču.

745
00:48:27,570 --> 00:48:30,150
And when I told my wife about sending that email,

746
00:48:31,650 --> 00:48:34,290
she wasn't overjoyed, but it was something very subtle.

747
00:48:35,310 --> 00:48:42,450
Kad sam ženi rekao da sam poslao taj email, ona nije bila nešto previše radosna, nego je bila puno, puno

748
00:48:44,910 --> 00:48:45,450
suptilnija.

749
00:48:45,810 --> 00:48:47,310
Yes. Something in her softened.

750
00:48:47,790 --> 00:48:49,410
Nešto u njoj je omekšalo.

751
00:48:50,070 --> 00:48:54,930
Like that lie of me loving ministry more than her. It's like that layer broke off.

752
00:48:55,170 --> 00:49:00,390
Kao da je ta laž da volim služenje više od nje, kao da se odvalila.

753
00:49:01,170 --> 00:49:05,970
And the next months of coming to the couch, we saw so much restoration happen there.

754
00:49:06,630 --> 00:49:13,290
I u idućim mjesecima i u dolascima na taj kauč, vidjeli smo jako puno obnove u odnosu koja se dogodila.

755
00:49:14,610 --> 00:49:19,050
Now, if that's your struggle, I can't promise you the same journey that Rose and I have had.

756
00:49:19,770 --> 00:49:25,830
Ako imate sličnu borbu, ne mogu vam obećati da trebate ići istim putem kojim smo Rose i ja išli.

757
00:49:27,030 --> 00:49:27,330
Ruža.

758
00:49:33,210 --> 00:49:36,030
But I'm going to say, if you make that choice, it's totally worth it.

759
00:49:36,390 --> 00:49:42,930
Ali ako odlučite napraviti taj odabir, u potpunosti je vrijedan toga.

760
00:49:43,110 --> 00:49:44,850
Because Jesus makes all things new.

761
00:49:45,210 --> 00:49:47,730
Jer Isus sve stvara novo, sve čini novo.

762
00:49:48,030 --> 00:49:51,090
In fact, do you want to know who recommended Encounter Ministries to me?

763
00:49:51,570 --> 00:49:53,970
Što mislite, tko mi je predložio Encounter Ministries?

764
00:49:54,330 --> 00:49:55,050
Surprise!

765
00:49:55,230 --> 00:49:55,950
Iznenađenje!

766
00:49:56,670 --> 00:49:57,270
It's my wife.

767
00:49:57,450 --> 00:49:57,810
Moja žena.

768
00:49:57,930 --> 00:50:05,190
It's my wife. And I'd go on to see more miracles with Encounter than I'd ever seen in my 10-plus years of ministry combined.

769
00:50:05,550 --> 00:50:11,970
I u Encounteru sam u kratko vrijeme vidio puno više čudesa i milosti nego u 10 godina služenja prije.

770
00:50:12,270 --> 00:50:14,010
But now she was with me in it.

771
00:50:14,190 --> 00:50:15,990
Ali ona je sad bila sa mnom u tome.

772
00:50:16,410 --> 00:50:17,070
Love is patient.

773
00:50:17,550 --> 00:50:18,450
Ljubav je strpljiva.

774
00:50:19,290 --> 00:50:20,370
Let's move to the next one.

775
00:50:20,490 --> 00:50:21,030
Idemo dalje.

776
00:50:22,050 --> 00:50:24,090
Love is kind. It is not rude.

777
00:50:24,330 --> 00:50:30,210
Ljubav je nježna. Nije... Nije nepristojna.

778
00:50:31,830 --> 00:50:37,830
Dobrostiva. We have very different translations.

779
00:50:37,950 --> 00:50:42,150
Oh, really? Yours is probably right.

780
00:50:44,490 --> 00:50:50,010
So go ahead and declare this: "I am kind."

781
00:50:53,550 --> 00:50:58,530
Ja sam dobrostiv. Ja sam dobrostiv.

782
00:51:00,690 --> 00:51:01,590
I am not rude.

783
00:51:03,570 --> 00:51:06,390
Nisam bezobrazan, nepristojan.

784
00:51:07,410 --> 00:51:11,910
Just pay attention to how that feels coming out of your mouth: "I am kind, I am not rude."

785
00:51:11,910 --> 00:51:14,130
Gledajte kako zvuči kad izlazi iz vaših usta.

786
00:51:20,310 --> 00:51:24,690
I think one of the most memorable passages in the Bible on rudeness.

787
00:51:24,930 --> 00:51:28,290
Jedan od najboljih citata o

788
00:51:30,390 --> 00:51:31,290
nepristojnosti.

789
00:51:32,070 --> 00:51:33,690
Is in 2 Kings chapter 2.

790
00:51:33,870 --> 00:51:37,230
I u 2. Kraljevima, 2. poglavlje.

791
00:51:37,590 --> 00:51:38,490
I'll paraphrase it.

792
00:51:38,850 --> 00:51:39,690
Parafrazirat ću.

793
00:51:40,710 --> 00:51:41,850
So we have Elisha.

794
00:51:42,270 --> 00:51:43,170
Imamo Elizeja.

795
00:51:43,410 --> 00:51:45,570
Who just received a double portion from Elijah.

796
00:51:45,810 --> 00:51:49,350
Koji je primio duplu porciju pomazanja i Duha i Linog.

797
00:51:49,530 --> 00:51:54,090
And then immediately he goes and miraculously purifies an entire city's water supply.

798
00:51:54,570 --> 00:51:56,670
I odlazi i na čudesan način

799
00:51:58,290 --> 00:52:02,010
očišćuje, dovodi vode za cijeli grad.

800
00:52:02,310 --> 00:52:03,570
Which is super awesome, right?

801
00:52:03,870 --> 00:52:05,430
To je vrhunski, ono, čudesno.

802
00:52:06,390 --> 00:52:07,470
Nobody thinks that's awesome.

803
00:52:07,650 --> 00:52:08,850
Nitko ne misli da je to čudesno.

804
00:52:10,110 --> 00:52:14,130
Okay. Well, it says, "From there, Elisha went up to Bethel."

805
00:52:14,490 --> 00:52:18,390
Kaže da je odande Elizej otišao u Betel.

806
00:52:18,810 --> 00:52:22,530
While he was on the way, some little boys came out of the city and jeered at him.

807
00:52:23,430 --> 00:52:30,930
I dok je išao prema gore, neki dječaci su izašli iz grada i počeli su ga... počeli su ga provocirati.

808
00:52:31,170 --> 00:52:33,990
They said, "Go away, Baldi! Go away, Baldi!"

809
00:52:34,050 --> 00:52:36,750
Govorili su mu: "Odi ćelavi, bježi ćelavi!"

810
00:52:37,890 --> 00:52:41,490
The prophet turned and saw them, and he cursed them in the name of the Lord.

811
00:52:41,970 --> 00:52:47,670
Prorok ih je vidio, okrenuo im se i prokleo ih u ime Isusovo, u ime Gospodnje.

812
00:52:48,510 --> 00:52:52,590
Then two shebears came out of the woods and tore 42 of the children to pieces.

813
00:52:53,670 --> 00:52:58,950
Onda su izašla 2 medvjeda i 42 djece, rasturila u komade.

814
00:52:59,550 --> 00:53:00,390
The word of the Lord.

815
00:53:00,810 --> 00:53:01,590
Riječ Gospodnja.

816
00:53:02,670 --> 00:53:06,150
Now, I don't know if Elisha was insecure about his hair loss.

817
00:53:06,450 --> 00:53:10,350
Nisam siguran da je Elizej bio baš nesiguran oko gubitka svoje kose.

818
00:53:11,010 --> 00:53:14,910
But it seems clear to me that the Lord does not like rudeness to the ones he loves.

819
00:53:16,110 --> 00:53:20,370
Ali siguran sam da Gospodin ne voli nepristojnost prema onima koje ljubi.

820
00:53:20,790 --> 00:53:25,290
Maybe this might also cause us to pause before we criticize how our spouse looks.

821
00:53:25,830 --> 00:53:33,690
Možda će nas ovo natjerati da se zaustavimo i pauziramo prije nego što kritiziramo svoje supružnike o tome kako izgledaju.

822
00:53:34,290 --> 00:53:36,930
But when we talk about kindness, we're talking about honor.

823
00:53:37,410 --> 00:53:41,070
Ali kad pričamo o nježnosti i dobrostivosti, pričamo o časti.

824
00:53:41,250 --> 00:53:44,670
Am I treating someone with the dignity that God has given them?

825
00:53:45,030 --> 00:53:50,970
Da li se odnosim prema nekome sa čašću i dostojanstvom koje je Gospodin dao toj osobi?

826
00:53:51,450 --> 00:53:53,490
Especially in the middle of disagreement.

827
00:53:54,030 --> 00:53:55,770
Posebice usred svađe.

828
00:53:56,010 --> 00:54:01,050
When maybe the dinner table feels like the table the Lord has set before you in front of your enemies.

829
00:54:02,250 --> 00:54:04,470
I kad se naš stol

830
00:54:05,670 --> 00:54:10,170
u blagovaonici čini kao stol koji je Gospodin postavio između tebe i tvog neprijatelja.

831
00:54:11,130 --> 00:54:14,610
Because sometimes in the middle of their brokenness, you don't see their dignity.

832
00:54:15,090 --> 00:54:20,310
Jer nekad usred toga da vidimo njihovu slomljenost, ne vidimo njihovo dostojanstvo.

833
00:54:20,490 --> 00:54:23,370
And you have to turn and ask God for His perspective.

834
00:54:23,730 --> 00:54:26,790
I moraš moliti Gospodina da ti pokaže Njegovu perspektivu.

835
00:54:27,330 --> 00:54:28,710
This is the way that I do this.

836
00:54:29,070 --> 00:54:30,510
Ovo je način na koji sam ja činio.

837
00:54:30,810 --> 00:54:35,670
I ask God, "Help me to see my spouse first as your beloved child."

838
00:54:36,990 --> 00:54:43,110
Molio sam Gospodina da mi da da vidim svoju suprugu kao Njegovo ljubljeno dijete.

839
00:54:43,530 --> 00:54:48,990
Then once I see that, I say, "Help me to see them walking in the full security of your love."

840
00:54:49,410 --> 00:54:55,830
A onda bih molio da mi pokaže, kad bi to vidio: "Daj mi da ju vidim kako hoda u punoj sigurnosti Tvoje ljubavi."

841
00:54:56,130 --> 00:55:02,610
And then when I see that, I say, "Help me to see them walking in the fullness of the gifting that You've put over their life."

842
00:55:02,910 --> 00:55:09,930
A kada bih to vidio, onda bih zamolio da mi Gospodin pokaže kako izgledaju u punini darova koje im je, koje joj je dao.

843
00:55:11,370 --> 00:55:14,970
Whenever I do this and I see how God sees my wife.

844
00:55:15,030 --> 00:55:18,450
Kada god bih to učinio i vidio kako Gospodin gleda moju suprugu.

845
00:55:19,170 --> 00:55:23,850
No matter how rude or indifferent she is to me.

846
00:55:24,270 --> 00:55:26,790
Bez obzira koliko bila možda nepristojna ili

847
00:55:28,230 --> 00:55:29,310
ravnodušna prema meni.

848
00:55:30,210 --> 00:55:33,510
Which I am as well to her. Okay, let's be fair.

849
00:55:33,750 --> 00:55:36,210
Kao što bih ja nekad bio prema njoj, ako ćemo biti fer.

850
00:55:36,450 --> 00:55:39,150
But when I see that vision, I fall in love with her all over again.

851
00:55:39,270 --> 00:55:41,790
Ali kad bih vidio tu viziju, opet bih se zaljubio u nju.

852
00:55:43,050 --> 00:55:47,250
I've told people, when my wife finally walks in her full authority.

853
00:55:47,850 --> 00:55:52,050
Rekao sam ljudima: "Kad moja žena bude hodala u svom punom autoritetu."

854
00:55:52,350 --> 00:55:55,650
I've seen, prophetically, she has more power than I have.

855
00:55:56,010 --> 00:55:58,050
Proročki sam vidio da je snažnija od mene.

856
00:55:58,170 --> 00:55:58,890
And I get jealous.

857
00:55:59,490 --> 00:56:00,330
Bio sam ljubomoran.

858
00:56:01,110 --> 00:56:05,190
And I think when we've discussed it, she's doing the same for me.

859
00:56:05,910 --> 00:56:09,510
I mislim da kad smo raspravljali o tome, ona isto tako mene vidi.

860
00:56:09,690 --> 00:56:11,790
She sees the same vision, but towards me.

861
00:56:12,270 --> 00:56:13,950
Istu viziju ima za mene.

862
00:56:14,670 --> 00:56:17,910
Seeing the Father's vision is so powerful for your spouse.

863
00:56:18,390 --> 00:56:23,730
Vidjeti Očev pogled i Očevu viziju o svojoj supruzi je jako snažno.

864
00:56:24,930 --> 00:56:26,010
Let's move to the next one.

865
00:56:26,610 --> 00:56:27,270
Idemo dalje.

866
00:56:27,570 --> 00:56:28,530
Love is not jealous.

867
00:56:29,190 --> 00:56:30,690
Ljubav ne zavidi.

868
00:56:30,990 --> 00:56:32,610
It does not seek its own interests.

869
00:56:33,030 --> 00:56:33,810
Ne traži svoje.

870
00:56:34,350 --> 00:56:38,430
Go ahead and declare this after Him: "I am not jealous."

871
00:56:39,630 --> 00:56:42,690
Proklamirajte ovo: "Ja ne zavidim."

872
00:56:44,370 --> 00:56:45,750
I don't seek my own interests.

873
00:56:46,170 --> 00:56:47,250
I ne tražim svoje.

874
00:56:50,670 --> 00:56:51,870
Pay attention to how that feels.

875
00:56:52,470 --> 00:56:55,170
Pogledajte kako to odzvanja u vašim srcima.

876
00:57:07,710 --> 00:57:09,210
For myself, I'll make a confession.

877
00:57:11,430 --> 00:57:12,570
Ispovijedat ću sebe.

878
00:57:13,050 --> 00:57:15,330
I'm an American, we seek our own interests.

879
00:57:15,510 --> 00:57:18,150
Ja sam Amerikanac i mi tražimo svoje.

880
00:57:20,670 --> 00:57:26,610
Statistically, we are 4% of the world's population, yet we account for one-third of the world's spending.

881
00:57:27,030 --> 00:57:34,170
Statistički, mi smo 4% svjetske populacije, a trošimo 1/3 svjetske potrošnje.

882
00:57:34,950 --> 00:57:38,550
Here's another confession: I'm the youngest sibling. Is anybody else in here?

883
00:57:38,730 --> 00:57:43,710
Još jedno priznanje: ja sam najmlađi od braće i sestara. Ima još netko?

884
00:57:44,130 --> 00:57:46,530
Here it is: we're a little self-absorbed.

885
00:57:47,310 --> 00:57:48,630
Mi smo malo puni sebe.

886
00:57:49,890 --> 00:57:52,050
Now, oldest siblings, chill out for a second.

887
00:57:52,350 --> 00:57:53,850
Svi ostali, samo se smirite.

888
00:57:53,970 --> 00:57:56,310
You don't have to agree with that so enthusiastically.

889
00:57:56,550 --> 00:57:59,370
Ne morate se tako entuzijastično s nama složiti oko toga.

890
00:57:59,910 --> 00:58:01,710
Now, why are we so self-absorbed?

891
00:58:02,010 --> 00:58:03,150
Zašto smo puni sebe?

892
00:58:03,330 --> 00:58:05,850
Because just most of the time, we didn't have to care for someone.

893
00:58:06,270 --> 00:58:08,850
Jer većinu vremena nismo morali brinuti o nikome drugome.

894
00:58:09,030 --> 00:58:11,010
It's not our fault that mom stopped having kids.

895
00:58:11,190 --> 00:58:13,530
Nije naša krivica što je mama prestala imati djecu.

896
00:58:15,810 --> 00:58:20,910
In 2019, my wife and I, we went on a Healing the Whole Person conference with Dr. Bob.

897
00:58:21,150 --> 00:58:25,830
2019. išli smo na konferenciju Iscjeljenje cijele osobe, dr. Boba Schutza.

898
00:58:26,130 --> 00:58:33,330
And some of you are aware that Dr. Bob, he outlines the 7 deadly sins and adds on the 7 deadly wounds.

899
00:58:34,830 --> 00:58:39,750
Neki od vas znaju da dr. Bob priča o 7 smrtnih grijeha i 7 smrtnih rana.

900
00:58:40,410 --> 00:58:44,310
One of the deadly sins I was surprised to connect with was greed.

901
00:58:45,090 --> 00:58:50,010
Jedan od 7 glavnih grijeha s kojima sam se vidio da sam povezan je pohlepa.

902
00:58:50,430 --> 00:58:53,850
Now, I never thought that was my problem, because we didn't have much money growing up.

903
00:58:54,030 --> 00:58:57,750
Nikad nisam mislio da je to moj problem jer nismo imali puno novca dok sam odrastao.

904
00:58:58,590 --> 00:59:03,270
But I found it interesting to hear him say greed is actually an attachment to security.

905
00:59:04,170 --> 00:59:09,030
Ono što me iznenadilo je kad je rekao da je pohlepa navezanost na sigurnost.

906
00:59:09,330 --> 00:59:13,230
Like, instead of turning to God as your provider, you turn to stuff.

907
00:59:13,650 --> 00:59:18,090
Umjesto da se osloniš na Boga koji proviđa, oslanjaš se na stvari, na materijalno.

908
00:59:18,690 --> 00:59:25,050
So in my family, as we amassed all this cheap stuff that we didn't need, it was actually sinful.

909
00:59:25,530 --> 00:59:33,030
I kao obitelj, dok smo se natrpavali jeftinim stvarima koje nam nisu bile potrebne, to je u stvari bilo grešno ponašanje.

910
00:59:33,690 --> 00:59:36,330
I got convicted of this months later.

911
00:59:36,750 --> 00:59:39,210
Poslije mi se to pokazalo, nakon nekoliko mjeseci.

912
00:59:39,450 --> 00:59:44,130
When I found a pair of shoes for me on eBay for $9, free shipping.

913
00:59:44,610 --> 00:59:50,430
Kad sam na eBayu pronašao tenisice, moj broj, za 9 dolara na eBayu, bez poštarine.

914
00:59:50,730 --> 00:59:52,110
That's cheaper than 9 euros.

915
00:59:52,470 --> 00:59:53,850
To je jeftinije nego 9 eura.

916
00:59:54,870 --> 00:59:56,850
So I place that order, and then what do I see?

917
00:59:57,570 --> 01:00:00,630
I naručio sam te tenisice, i što sam poslije toga vidio?

918
01:00:01,050 --> 01:00:04,710
The same seller selling another pair for $5, free shipping.

919
01:00:05,130 --> 01:00:09,510
Isti čovjek prodaje još jedan par za 5 dolara, isto bez poštarine.

920
01:00:09,690 --> 01:00:12,090
And two others for $1, free shipping.

921
01:00:12,450 --> 01:00:15,030
I još dvoje za po 1 dolar, bez poštarine.

922
01:00:15,210 --> 01:00:17,190
So what did I do without asking my wife?

923
01:00:17,490 --> 01:00:19,170
Što sam napravio bez da sam pitao ženu?

924
01:00:19,290 --> 01:00:20,130
I bought them all.

925
01:00:20,550 --> 01:00:21,390
Sve sam ih kupio.

926
01:00:22,530 --> 01:00:24,330
And I know what you're thinking, but you're wrong.

927
01:00:24,510 --> 01:00:26,070
Znam što mislite i u krivu ste.

928
01:00:26,310 --> 01:00:27,090
They did arrive.

929
01:00:27,450 --> 01:00:28,170
One su došle.

930
01:00:28,590 --> 01:00:29,790
In this giant box.

931
01:00:30,210 --> 01:00:31,170
U ogromnoj kutiji.

932
01:00:31,350 --> 01:00:35,310
I brought it into my house. It was taped up. I pulled back the tape.

933
01:00:36,030 --> 01:00:40,410
Unio sam u kuću cijelu kutiju, bile su zalijepljene, otrgnuo sam traku.

934
01:00:40,710 --> 01:00:45,270
I open it up and there's a sign on top that says "Free Gift."

935
01:00:45,810 --> 01:00:49,650
Otvorio sam kutiju i unutra je bilo: "Znak: besplatni dar."

936
01:00:50,250 --> 01:00:57,030
And inside, I'm counting: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8.

937
01:00:57,270 --> 01:01:00,090
Izbrojao sam 8 parova cipela.

938
01:01:00,630 --> 01:01:06,570
In addition to the 4 pairs of shoes that I ordered, are 4 additional pairs of shoes in this box.

939
01:01:06,810 --> 01:01:09,690
Uz 4 koje sam naručio i još 4 besplatna para.

940
01:01:10,470 --> 01:01:18,510
Now, part of me was really creeped out. Like, I was expecting, like, this package will self-destruct in 3, 2, 1.

941
01:01:20,070 --> 01:01:27,450
Dio mene je bio malo i uznemiren, mislio sam da će uskoro početi zvuk: "Ovaj paket će eksplodirati za 3, 2, 1."

942
01:01:28,710 --> 01:01:36,210
But I remember in that moment, I just turned to the Lord and I was like, "Lord, I don't need any of these shoes."

943
01:01:36,750 --> 01:01:42,030
Ali u tom trenutku sam se okrenuo i progovorio Bogu: "Gospodine, ne trebam nijednu od ovih cipela."

944
01:01:42,510 --> 01:01:46,770
It was like St. Paul says in Romans, the kindness of God leads to repentance.

945
01:01:47,130 --> 01:01:53,070
Kad Pavao kaže: "Božja dobrota vodi prema pokajanju."

946
01:01:53,250 --> 01:01:56,310
And I was so convicted that I actually ended up giving all the shoes away.

947
01:01:56,610 --> 01:01:59,490
Bio sam toliko uvjeren da sam sve cipele podijelio.

948
01:01:59,850 --> 01:02:12,030
And that conviction stayed with me. I found myself going to the store, and if there were 2 items of the same item, but one was on sale and one was not, I would end up buying the more expensive item.

949
01:02:12,570 --> 01:02:20,370
Bio sam toliko uvjeren u to da kad bih otišao u dućan i našao 2 artikla koja su ista, jedan koji je na popustu, drugi koji nije, kupio bih onaj koji nije na popustu.

950
01:02:20,910 --> 01:02:22,470
Not because it was a better product.

951
01:02:22,770 --> 01:02:24,270
Ne zato što je to bio bolji proizvod.

952
01:02:24,570 --> 01:02:27,570
But because I wanted to break the power that greed had over me.

953
01:02:27,750 --> 01:02:32,010
Nego zato što sam želio slomiti moć pohlepe koju je imala nada mnom.

954
01:02:32,310 --> 01:02:36,690
And I wanted to respond to something that the Lord told me years earlier that I want to share with you.

955
01:02:37,050 --> 01:02:41,610
I želio sam odgovoriti na nešto što mi je Gospodin progovorio godinama ranije, što ću podijeliti s vama.

956
01:02:41,910 --> 01:02:45,090
When I first met my wife, it was in a young adult prayer group.

957
01:02:45,270 --> 01:02:47,370
Kada sam upoznao svoju suprugu, bilo je to u

958
01:02:49,530 --> 01:02:51,330
jednoj molitvenoj grupi mladih.

959
01:02:51,630 --> 01:02:54,090
And most of it was really good. We prayed with each other.

960
01:02:54,330 --> 01:02:56,670
Većinom je bilo jako dobro, molili smo jedni za druge.

961
01:02:57,450 --> 01:03:01,410
But we also discovered, in this small group of 7 or 8 of us.

962
01:03:01,530 --> 01:03:04,770
Ali smo otkrili da u malim grupama od nas 7 ili 8.

963
01:03:04,950 --> 01:03:08,490
Whenever prayer would get heightened, like very anointed.

964
01:03:08,910 --> 01:03:11,010
Kad bi molitva postala jako pomazana.

965
01:03:11,610 --> 01:03:18,750
About half of the ladies, including my wife Rose, would end up on the floor writhing in what we discerned were demonic manifestations.

966
01:03:20,010 --> 01:03:27,210
Polovica djevojaka, među kojima i moja žena, bi završile na podu i imale nešto što smo mi nazvali demonološke reakcije.

967
01:03:27,570 --> 01:03:34,590
And the leaders would make sure they were safe, but essentially it was just waiting it out, nothing resolved, and it was happening every week.

968
01:03:35,310 --> 01:03:45,990
I voditelji su uvijek pazili da one budu na sigurnom i da sve bude dobro, ali kako su tjedni prolazili, ništa se nije mijenjalo i sve se događalo iznova i iznova.

969
01:03:46,230 --> 01:03:49,890
And I remember driving home one day, just crying out to the Lord.

970
01:03:50,010 --> 01:03:54,450
Sjećam se dok sam se vozio jednog dana doma i molio, vapio Bogu.

971
01:03:55,110 --> 01:03:58,470
And I said, "Lord, what will it take to get our sisters free?"

972
01:03:58,830 --> 01:04:04,770
I pitao sam ga: "Gospodine, što je potrebno da naše sestre budu oslobođene?"

973
01:04:05,070 --> 01:04:09,150
And what I heard back surprised me. It was as clear as day. I heard detachment.

974
01:04:09,510 --> 01:04:16,950
Ono što sam čuo i što me jako pogodilo je nenavezanost. Odgovor je bio nenavezanost.

975
01:04:17,430 --> 01:04:20,790
And a response came right out of me, and immediately I said, "No."

976
01:04:21,390 --> 01:04:24,930
I odmah iz mene je izletio odgovor koji je bio: "Ne."

977
01:04:25,830 --> 01:04:30,690
Because it was like God was telling me, "Kevin, if you want to take on the enemy."

978
01:04:31,410 --> 01:04:35,670
Jer mi je Gospodin govorio: "Kevine, ako se želiš boriti protiv neprijatelja."

979
01:04:36,210 --> 01:04:38,610
You can't be divided. He'll use that against you.

980
01:04:38,850 --> 01:04:41,610
Ne možeš biti podijeljen, iskoristit će to protiv tebe.

981
01:04:42,210 --> 01:04:45,510
And in that moment, I knew I was attached to so many things.

982
01:04:45,750 --> 01:04:50,310
I u tom trenutku sam automatski znao da sam navezan na toliko puno stvari.

983
01:04:50,850 --> 01:04:51,270
Movies.

984
01:04:52,050 --> 01:04:52,530
Filmovi.

985
01:04:52,770 --> 01:04:53,250
Music.

986
01:04:53,610 --> 01:04:54,030
Glazba.

987
01:04:54,330 --> 01:04:54,750
Shopping.

988
01:04:55,530 --> 01:04:56,250
Šopingiranje.

989
01:04:56,430 --> 01:04:56,910
Drinking.

990
01:04:58,050 --> 01:04:58,410
Pijenje.

991
01:04:59,310 --> 01:05:02,610
And I wasn't willing, I wasn't ready to let those things go.

992
01:05:02,850 --> 01:05:05,130
I nisam bio spreman otpustiti te stvari.

993
01:05:05,550 --> 01:05:08,190
I was serving two masters, God and mammon.

994
01:05:08,850 --> 01:05:12,210
Služio sam dvojici gospodara, Bogu i bogatstvu.

995
01:05:12,570 --> 01:05:16,770
So as I headed into marriage, I was still very attached to many things.

996
01:05:16,950 --> 01:05:20,310
Kako sam ulazio u brak, i dalje sam bio jako navezan na mnogo stvari.

997
01:05:20,850 --> 01:05:22,350
I want to talk about entertainment.

998
01:05:22,530 --> 01:05:24,450
Želim razgovarati o zabavi.

999
01:05:24,630 --> 01:05:25,410
I love movies.

1000
01:05:25,770 --> 01:05:26,490
Volim filmove.

1001
01:05:26,850 --> 01:05:30,330
Growing up, it was a very sheltered home. We didn't get to watch a lot of movies.

1002
01:05:30,930 --> 01:05:35,190
Dok sam odrastao, bili smo u jako zatvorenom kućanstvu, nismo gledali puno filmova.

1003
01:05:35,730 --> 01:05:37,110
But now I'm an adult.

1004
01:05:37,410 --> 01:05:38,370
Sada sam odrastao.

1005
01:05:38,970 --> 01:05:40,530
So I could watch whatever I wanted.

1006
01:05:40,890 --> 01:05:42,210
Mogu gledati što god želim.

1007
01:05:42,330 --> 01:05:45,450
I remember going to the pawn shop. They had $2 DVDs.

1008
01:05:46,650 --> 01:05:50,970
Sjećam se da sam išao u zalagaonicu, imali su filmove za 2 dolara.

1009
01:05:51,150 --> 01:05:54,510
So I built this huge collection, hundreds of movies.

1010
01:05:54,750 --> 01:05:57,330
Imao sam ovu ogromnu kolekciju sa stotinama filmova.

1011
01:05:57,630 --> 01:06:00,510
Same with music, massive collection of music.

1012
01:06:00,510 --> 01:06:02,070
Isto sa glazbom, ogromna kolekcija.

1013
01:06:02,250 --> 01:06:03,270
And it was all secular.

1014
01:06:03,510 --> 01:06:04,950
I sve je bilo svjetovno.

1015
01:06:05,610 --> 01:06:08,190
Now, with all of these voices, with all of this content.

1016
01:06:08,670 --> 01:06:11,190
Sa svim tim glasovima i svim tim sadržajem.

1017
01:06:11,970 --> 01:06:15,330
How much of this environment do you think was holy?

1018
01:06:15,510 --> 01:06:17,610
Koliko tog okruženja je bilo sveto?

1019
01:06:18,870 --> 01:06:22,950
I actually began to see, when I would put on something of darker nature.

1020
01:06:23,070 --> 01:06:26,490
Kad bih stavio nešto tamnije naravi, mračnije naravi.

1021
01:06:27,030 --> 01:06:30,510
Like, say a movie, the darkness of that movie that I put on.

1022
01:06:30,630 --> 01:06:32,670
Kad bih stavio film neki koji je bio mračniji,

1023
01:06:34,350 --> 01:06:36,750
mrak tog filma, tama tog filma.

1024
01:06:36,930 --> 01:06:41,730
Yeah, it would linger in my home, primarily with my wife.

1025
01:06:42,090 --> 01:06:46,290
Kao da bi se uvukla u naš dom, prvenstveno s mojom ženom.

1026
01:06:46,710 --> 01:06:53,250
Almost every time she would have these nightmares or night terrors, and she'd get angry with me for having her watch it with me.

1027
01:06:53,970 --> 01:07:01,290
I gotovo uvijek bi imala noćne more i noćne napadaje, i bila bi ljuta na mene zato što sam ju nagovorio da gleda sama.

1028
01:07:02,010 --> 01:07:04,350
So as I started to enter into healing ministry.

1029
01:07:04,770 --> 01:07:07,110
Kako sam počeo ulaziti u službu ozdravljanja.

1030
01:07:07,410 --> 01:07:08,910
I felt the Lord telling me this.

1031
01:07:09,150 --> 01:07:11,130
Osjetio sam kao da mi Gospodin govori ovo.

1032
01:07:11,430 --> 01:07:16,290
He said, "Kevin, what you keep will sow roots in your home."

1033
01:07:17,130 --> 01:07:23,730
I rekao mi je: "Kevine, što zadržiš, posijat će sjemenje i pustiti korijenje u tvome domu."

1034
01:07:24,090 --> 01:07:28,050
So one day I went through each of the hundreds of movies I had.

1035
01:07:28,230 --> 01:07:30,810
I jednog dana sam prošao kroz stotine filmova koje imam.

1036
01:07:31,290 --> 01:07:37,530
I picked it up and I discerned one: does this leave me feeling upbuilt, encouraged, and consoled?

1037
01:07:39,330 --> 01:07:45,210
Da li me ovo ostavlja nakon što pogledam uzdignutim, ohrabrenim, utješenim?

1038
01:07:45,630 --> 01:07:48,210
If the answer is no, I'd throw it in the Get Rid of pile.

1039
01:07:48,510 --> 01:07:51,210
Ako je odgovor bio ne, bacio bih u kantu za smeće.

1040
01:07:51,510 --> 01:07:54,810
And number 2: does this affect my wife negatively?

1041
01:07:55,230 --> 01:07:58,050
I drugo pitanje je bilo: da li utječe na moju ženu negativno?

1042
01:07:58,290 --> 01:08:01,530
If the answer was yes, I threw it in the Get Rid of pile.

1043
01:08:01,770 --> 01:08:05,070
Ako je odgovor bio da, bacio sam ga u kantu za smeće.

1044
01:08:05,250 --> 01:08:07,170
And I really loved some of these movies.

1045
01:08:07,650 --> 01:08:09,210
Jako sam volio neke od tih filmova.

1046
01:08:09,930 --> 01:08:12,930
But I felt God teaching me, "Kevin, you're one now."

1047
01:08:13,590 --> 01:08:17,730
Ali sam osjetio kao da me Gospodin uči: "Kevine, sada si jedno."

1048
01:08:18,030 --> 01:08:21,510
And what's an obstacle for your spouse is an obstacle for you.

1049
01:08:21,870 --> 01:08:24,450
Što je prepreka tvojoj ženi, prepreka je tebi.

1050
01:08:24,870 --> 01:08:27,210
Like, even though I didn't have an issue with any of these.

1051
01:08:27,630 --> 01:08:30,210
Iako osobno nisam imao nikakav problem s nekim od tih filmova.

1052
01:08:30,450 --> 01:08:33,210
What's an obstacle for your spouse is an obstacle for you.

1053
01:08:33,570 --> 01:08:35,550
Što je prepreka tvojoj ženi, prepreka je tebi.

1054
01:08:36,750 --> 01:08:39,030
Because love doesn't seek its own interests.

1055
01:08:39,330 --> 01:08:40,890
Zato što ljubav ne traži svoje.

1056
01:08:41,610 --> 01:08:43,650
It seeks unity, compatibility.

1057
01:08:43,890 --> 01:08:45,690
Traži jedinstvo, kompatibilnost.

1058
01:08:46,050 --> 01:08:51,330
Do you know that the word "compatible" in Latin, it actually means "to suffer with"?

1059
01:08:51,570 --> 01:08:56,550
Znate li da riječ "kompatibilnost" na latinskom znači "patiti s nekime"?

1060
01:08:56,850 --> 01:08:59,790
So in some way, your spouse's crosses become yours.

1061
01:09:00,390 --> 01:09:03,930
Na neki način, križevi tvoje supruge postaju tvoji.

1062
01:09:04,350 --> 01:09:07,230
So if it leads your spouse to sin, just cut it off.

1063
01:09:07,470 --> 01:09:10,590
Ako tvoju ženu ili muža vodi u grijeh, odreži to.

1064
01:09:12,870 --> 01:09:14,610
I want to mention music briefly too.

1065
01:09:14,910 --> 01:09:16,830
Želim kratko spomenuti glazbu.

1066
01:09:19,530 --> 01:09:23,910
Have you noticed how praise music helps to usher our souls into the presence of God?

1067
01:09:24,510 --> 01:09:31,110
Jeste li možda primijetili kako glazba slavljenja nas uvodi u prisutnost Gospodinovu?

1068
01:09:31,590 --> 01:09:36,630
And somehow it's spiritually infused with the artist who wrote it.

1069
01:09:36,870 --> 01:09:42,210
I kao da je na neki način duhovno povezana s čovjekom koji je napisao, s autorom.

1070
01:09:42,390 --> 01:09:43,770
The prayer of the artist, I should say.

1071
01:09:44,250 --> 01:09:46,290
S molitvom autora, rekao bih.

1072
01:09:46,350 --> 01:09:50,010
Have you ever considered that secular music is also spiritually infused?

1073
01:09:50,370 --> 01:09:53,970
Jeste li ikad razmislili da je i svjetovna glazba duhovno nadahnuta?

1074
01:09:54,450 --> 01:09:57,030
Now, I used to be in rock bands.

1075
01:09:57,390 --> 01:09:59,190
Ja sam prije bio u rock bendovima.

1076
01:09:59,610 --> 01:10:05,790
So what I primarily listened to was infused with heartbreak and ego and anger.

1077
01:10:06,150 --> 01:10:11,250
Ono što sam prije slušao je bilo ispunjeno slomljenim srcima, egom

1078
01:10:12,930 --> 01:10:13,770
i ostalim stvarima.

1079
01:10:13,950 --> 01:10:16,710
Yeah. It was primarily how artists released their pain.

1080
01:10:17,250 --> 01:10:20,970
Bio je način na koji su autori ispoljavali svoju bol.

1081
01:10:22,050 --> 01:10:25,050
And so I'm welcoming that into our home, and we're singing along with it.

1082
01:10:25,470 --> 01:10:29,430
Ja sam to pozdravljao u svoj dom i zajedno smo pjevali te pjesme.

1083
01:10:30,570 --> 01:10:32,790
I want to read in Ephesians 4, it says.

1084
01:10:33,150 --> 01:10:34,530
U Efežanima 4 kaže.

1085
01:10:35,550 --> 01:10:37,470
"No foul language should come out of your mouth."

1086
01:10:38,850 --> 01:10:42,330
Nikakav zao jezik ne bi trebao izlaziti iz tvojih usta.

1087
01:10:42,690 --> 01:10:46,050
"But only such as is good for needed edification."

1088
01:10:46,590 --> 01:10:48,990
Samo onaj koji je dobar za potrebno izgrađivanje.

1089
01:10:49,350 --> 01:10:55,950
And then it says, "All bitterness, fury, anger, shouting, and reviling must be removed from you."

1090
01:10:56,430 --> 01:10:59,970
Svaka ogorčenost, ljutnja,

1091
01:11:02,250 --> 01:11:05,130
deranje treba biti uklonjeno od tebe.

1092
01:11:08,490 --> 01:11:10,530
And I was very attached to all of this.

1093
01:11:10,710 --> 01:11:12,810
A ja sam bio jako navezan na sve to.

1094
01:11:13,290 --> 01:11:16,830
Ephesians 4 goes on to say, "Do not leave a foothold to the enemy."

1095
01:11:17,190 --> 01:11:20,250
Efežani 4 kaže: "Nemoj ostaviti prostora neprijatelju."

1096
01:11:20,490 --> 01:11:23,190
So I was convicted, and I got rid of all of it.

1097
01:11:23,610 --> 01:11:26,250
Bio sam uvjeren u to i svega sam se riješio.

1098
01:11:27,690 --> 01:11:34,290
Now I want you to listen to me carefully. I'm not sharing this to condemn anybody for what you watch or listen to.

1099
01:11:34,710 --> 01:11:39,450
I želim sad samo naglasiti da ne želimo suditi nikoga zbog onog što gledaju ili slušaju.

1100
01:11:39,690 --> 01:11:42,810
Or what's considered art, or what's okay by Catholic teaching.

1101
01:11:43,290 --> 01:11:49,290
Ili s onime što se smatra umjetnošću ili što je okej s kršćanskim i katoličkim naukom.

1102
01:11:49,950 --> 01:11:54,270
Because for those of you that are married, your obstacles with your spouse are going to look different than mine.

1103
01:11:54,510 --> 01:12:00,390
Jer za sve vas koji ste vjenčani, vaše prepreke s vašim supružnicima su drugačije nego one koje su moje.

1104
01:12:00,810 --> 01:12:05,550
But I want you to hear this fruit, because when we made these changes, something started to happen.

1105
01:12:05,790 --> 01:12:11,190
Ja želim s vama sad podijeliti plod onoga što se dogodilo nakon što smo promijenili ove stvari.

1106
01:12:11,910 --> 01:12:14,370
Little by little, the presence of our home shifted.

1107
01:12:14,730 --> 01:12:17,250
Malo po malo, prisutnost u našem domu se promijenila.

1108
01:12:18,330 --> 01:12:22,530
Like, without these outside voices, it suddenly became very easy to pray.

1109
01:12:23,190 --> 01:12:26,370
Bez ovih vanjskih glasova postalo je jako jednostavno moliti.

1110
01:12:26,790 --> 01:12:31,890
I started learning guitar. I had like five guitars, but I never learned how to play them.

1111
01:12:32,130 --> 01:12:36,270
Počeo sam učiti svirati gitaru, iako sam kući imao 5 gitara i nikad ih nisam taknuo.

1112
01:12:36,450 --> 01:12:39,210
And I started learning worship songs, because it only needs 4 chords.

1113
01:12:39,570 --> 01:12:42,750
Počeo sam učiti slavljenje Gospodnjega jer trebaju samo 4 akorda.

1114
01:12:43,530 --> 01:12:45,630
And my family, we started worshiping together.

1115
01:12:45,810 --> 01:12:47,070
Počeli smo zajedno slaviti.

1116
01:12:48,450 --> 01:12:52,470
Rose and I, as we started coming to the couch, we started doing spiritual reading together.

1117
01:12:53,430 --> 01:12:57,450
Rose i ja, kako bismo sjeli na kauč, počeli smo zajedno čitati duhovno štivo.

1118
01:12:57,690 --> 01:13:03,210
I would be reading out loud to my wife, and then we'd pause and we'd have these deep discussions about it.

1119
01:13:03,570 --> 01:13:09,030
Počeo bih naglas čitati nešto i onda bi zastali i imali duboke rasprave o tome.

1120
01:13:09,330 --> 01:13:12,930
In just one year, we got through over 40 books on healing and deliverance.

1121
01:13:13,350 --> 01:13:16,950
U jednoj godini pročitali smo 40 knjiga o ozdravljenju i oslobođenju.

1122
01:13:17,190 --> 01:13:22,050
Which is a big deal, because I hadn't finished a single book in the previous 10 years before that.

1123
01:13:22,290 --> 01:13:26,130
Što je velika stvar, jer prije toga u 10 godina nisam dovršio niti jednu knjigu.

1124
01:13:27,870 --> 01:13:30,810
Love is not jealous. It does not seek its own interests.

1125
01:13:31,050 --> 01:13:33,030
Ljubav ne zavidi i ne traži svoje.

1126
01:13:33,570 --> 01:13:34,530
Let's move to the next one.

1127
01:13:34,650 --> 01:13:35,190
Idemo dalje.

1128
01:13:35,850 --> 01:13:38,550
Love is not pompous. It is not inflated.

1129
01:13:38,970 --> 01:13:41,130
Ljubav se ne nadima, ne hvasta se.

1130
01:13:41,970 --> 01:13:44,790
Go ahead and declare this: I am not pompous.

1131
01:13:46,230 --> 01:13:47,130
Ne nadimam se.

1132
01:13:49,590 --> 01:13:50,670
I am not inflated.

1133
01:13:50,850 --> 01:13:51,810
I ne hvastam se.

1134
01:13:53,850 --> 01:13:55,050
Just pay attention to how that feels.

1135
01:13:55,950 --> 01:13:57,390
Osluhnite kako to zvuči.

1136
01:14:07,290 --> 01:14:11,310
Now, for this one, I want to get a little vulnerable with you. Are you guys okay with that?

1137
01:14:12,030 --> 01:14:14,910
Za ovaj dio, želio bih biti malo ranjiv prema vama, je li vam to u redu?

1138
01:14:16,590 --> 01:14:20,130
In the week I've been here, I've learned that's not necessarily the Croatian way.

1139
01:14:21,630 --> 01:14:25,050
U ovom tjednu u kojem sam bio ovdje, to nije baš neki hrvatski način djelovanja.

1140
01:14:25,830 --> 01:14:29,370
So I mentioned, when I got married, I continued leading ministry.

1141
01:14:29,550 --> 01:14:32,850
Kad sam se vjenčao, nastavio sam voditi službu.

1142
01:14:33,630 --> 01:14:37,470
But as we continued to have 3 kids in the first 5 years of marriage.

1143
01:14:37,710 --> 01:14:39,870
I kako smo u prvih 5 godina dobili troje djece.

1144
01:14:40,290 --> 01:14:46,290
I kept leading because in many ways I felt I needed to step out of my home to experience the love of Jesus.

1145
01:14:46,950 --> 01:14:53,310
I nastavio sam voditi jer na mnoge načine sam osjećao kao da moram izaći iz kuće da bih osjetio Kristovu ljubav.

1146
01:14:53,430 --> 01:14:57,270
Because leading retreats and watching people come to Jesus, that was so exciting.

1147
01:14:57,690 --> 01:15:03,570
Jer voditi duhovne obnove i vidjeti kako se ljudi obraćaju i dolaze Isusu bilo je toliko uzbuđujuće.

1148
01:15:03,930 --> 01:15:07,830
But then I'd come home and I'd just feel this darkness, this chaos.

1149
01:15:08,370 --> 01:15:11,250
Ali onda bih došao kući i osjetio bih tamu i kaos.

1150
01:15:11,850 --> 01:15:16,110
And my wife was overwhelmed, not just with the kids.

1151
01:15:16,350 --> 01:15:18,510
Moja žena je bila preplavljena ne samo djecom.

1152
01:15:19,470 --> 01:15:23,730
But as we hit about 6 years into marriage, parts of her past were coming to the surface.

1153
01:15:23,970 --> 01:15:29,910
Ali kako smo došli u 6. godinu braka, dio njene povijesti je ponovno došao na površinu.

1154
01:15:30,150 --> 01:15:33,030
And they were influencing what she believed about me and our marriage.

1155
01:15:33,210 --> 01:15:36,390
I počelo je utjecati na ono što je vjerovala o meni i o našem braku.

1156
01:15:37,110 --> 01:15:39,210
I remember one day, it was Father's Day.

1157
01:15:39,450 --> 01:15:40,950
Sjećam se, bio je Dan očeva.

1158
01:15:41,370 --> 01:15:46,110
I was getting into our van and I heard my oldest child, who's 5 at the time, say this to my wife.

1159
01:15:46,290 --> 01:15:51,750
Ulazio sam u naš kombi i čuo sam kako moj petogodišnji sin govori mojoj ženi.

1160
01:15:52,230 --> 01:15:54,930
"I wish Dad was dead. I want a new dad."

1161
01:15:55,350 --> 01:15:57,690
Volio bih da je tata mrtav, želim novog tatu.

1162
01:15:59,310 --> 01:16:05,430
Not long after that, my wife confessed to me that she told him, "It's okay, God might be giving you a new dad."

1163
01:16:07,170 --> 01:16:13,950
Žena mi je nakon par dana priznala da mu je rekla: "U redu je to što misliš, Bog ti može i dan novog tatu."

1164
01:16:14,670 --> 01:16:15,990
So we had some painful talks.

1165
01:16:16,530 --> 01:16:18,450
Imali smo neke jako bolne razgovore.

1166
01:16:18,990 --> 01:16:21,390
And the logic that I heard from her went something like this.

1167
01:16:21,870 --> 01:16:24,330
I logika koju sam čuo od nje je išla ovako.

1168
01:16:24,930 --> 01:16:26,970
"Kevin, I'm miserable married to you."

1169
01:16:27,450 --> 01:16:29,490
"Kevine, očajna sam u braku s tobom."

1170
01:16:29,850 --> 01:16:33,450
And if I have to stay married to you, either God wants me miserable.

1171
01:16:33,870 --> 01:16:38,010
I ako trebam ostati vjenčana s tobom, ili me Bog želi očajnu.

1172
01:16:38,370 --> 01:16:41,730
Or if God doesn't want me miserable, then He has someone different for me.

1173
01:16:41,970 --> 01:16:44,790
Ili ako me Bog ne želi očajnu, On ima nekog drugog za mene.

1174
01:16:45,450 --> 01:16:49,170
And because we are faithful Catholics, that would mean that our marriage was invalid.

1175
01:16:49,410 --> 01:16:53,910
A budući da smo vjerni katolici, to bi značilo i da naš brak ne valja.

1176
01:16:54,270 --> 01:16:55,230
And could be annulled.

1177
01:16:55,470 --> 01:16:57,870
I trebao bi biti razriješen.

1178
01:16:58,110 --> 01:17:00,150
And so she told me this.

1179
01:17:00,330 --> 01:17:01,290
Rekla mi je ovo.

1180
01:17:01,770 --> 01:17:04,950
"On the bright side, you'd be fully free to commit to ministry."

1181
01:17:06,210 --> 01:17:08,910
S svjetlije strane, mogao bih se potpuno posvetiti služenju.

1182
01:17:09,150 --> 01:17:10,590
Maybe you could even become a priest.

1183
01:17:10,890 --> 01:17:12,330
Možda čak možeš postati svećenik.

1184
01:17:14,550 --> 01:17:19,590
I'm not going to lie, when I heard that, that was the biggest gut punch I ever felt in my life.

1185
01:17:19,950 --> 01:17:25,710
Moram vam priznati, to je bilo najveći udarac, niski udarac koji sam osjetio u životu.

1186
01:17:26,310 --> 01:17:30,270
And as she said it, there was this thick, taunting darkness to it.

1187
01:17:30,570 --> 01:17:35,790
I kako je to izgovarao, bila je ta debela, proganjajuća tama koja je pratila riječi.

1188
01:17:36,090 --> 01:17:38,250
And I knew it wasn't just coming from my wife.

1189
01:17:38,430 --> 01:17:40,230
I znao sam da ne dolazi samo od moje žene.

1190
01:17:40,530 --> 01:17:42,210
And I knew it was affecting my kids.

1191
01:17:43,230 --> 01:17:44,730
I znao sam da utječe na moju djecu.

1192
01:17:45,270 --> 01:17:48,990
So I tried talking and reasoning with her, but it was like talking to a wall.

1193
01:17:49,290 --> 01:17:53,730
Pokušao sam s njom razgovarati, uvjeriti ju, ali bilo je kao da razgovaram sa zidom.

1194
01:17:54,990 --> 01:17:58,590
I remember for a week, I could hardly eat or sleep.

1195
01:17:58,710 --> 01:18:02,310
Sjećam se da sam tjedan dana nisam gotovo ni jeo ni spavao.

1196
01:18:02,670 --> 01:18:05,490
I prayed like I'd never prayed before, with desperation.

1197
01:18:06,030 --> 01:18:08,250
Molio sam kao nikad prije, iz očaja.

1198
01:18:08,910 --> 01:18:12,510
I remember on my knees one night, just saying, "Lord, please."

1199
01:18:13,470 --> 01:18:17,490
Sjećam se, na koljenima jedna večer sam molio i govorio: "Gospodine, molim te."

1200
01:18:17,730 --> 01:18:19,410
I don't know how it got this bad.

1201
01:18:19,830 --> 01:18:22,770
Ne znam kako je došlo do ovako loše situacije.

1202
01:18:22,950 --> 01:18:25,050
But if you can save my marriage, I'll give you anything.

1203
01:18:25,350 --> 01:18:27,630
Ali ako možeš spasiti moj brak, dat ću ti sve.

1204
01:18:28,350 --> 01:18:32,370
The next morning, I wasn't sleeping, so I drugged myself to a really early mass.

1205
01:18:32,850 --> 01:18:36,450
I budući da nisam spavao, to jutro sam se odvezao na jednu vrlo ranu misu.

1206
01:18:36,750 --> 01:18:39,330
The gospel was Jesus's teaching on divorce.

1207
01:18:40,410 --> 01:18:44,310
I evanđelje je bilo Isusovo učenje o rastavi.

1208
01:18:44,730 --> 01:18:49,830
And the priest kept saying in his homily, "Jesus will not divorce you. Jesus will not divorce you."

1209
01:18:49,950 --> 01:18:55,290
I svećenik je nastavio u svojoj propovijedi govoriti: "Isus te neće rastaviti, Isus te neće rastaviti."

1210
01:18:55,350 --> 01:18:59,730
And I was going up to communion, and I had tears just streaming down my face.

1211
01:18:59,910 --> 01:19:03,030
Išao sam na pričest i suze su mi lile niz lice.

1212
01:19:03,270 --> 01:19:05,910
I remember thinking, the priest probably thinks I'm so weird right now.

1213
01:19:06,150 --> 01:19:09,150
I sjećam se da sam mislio kako svećenik misli da sam jako čudan trenutno.

1214
01:19:09,570 --> 01:19:13,710
And I remember I needed a friend so badly at that time.

1215
01:19:14,070 --> 01:19:17,550
Sjećam se koliko mi je očajno trebao dobar prijatelj u tom trenutku.

1216
01:19:17,730 --> 01:19:21,210
But at the same time, I was so scared to talk badly about my wife.

1217
01:19:21,450 --> 01:19:24,630
Ali toliko sam bio uplašen govoriti išta loše o svojoj ženi.

1218
01:19:24,990 --> 01:19:27,690
It's the same reason why it's hard for me to share today.

1219
01:19:28,710 --> 01:19:30,990
Zato mi je teško i danas govoriti o ovome.

1220
01:19:31,530 --> 01:19:33,570
But knowing she, I have her here with me.

1221
01:19:33,810 --> 01:19:35,010
Ali znam da je ona tu sa mnom.

1222
01:19:35,130 --> 01:19:37,230
Because the reality is, she's an incredible woman.

1223
01:19:37,350 --> 01:19:39,210
Zato što je realnost da je ona nevjerojatna žena.

1224
01:19:39,390 --> 01:19:40,410
And she always has been.

1225
01:19:40,590 --> 01:19:41,370
I uvijek je bila.

1226
01:19:42,510 --> 01:19:45,990
But sometimes you need to see the valley to understand the victory.

1227
01:19:46,170 --> 01:19:52,230
Ali ponekad treba vidjeti dolinu da bi se shvatila vrijednost pobjede i vrhunca, vrhova.

1228
01:19:52,830 --> 01:19:56,970
Psalm 34 says, "The Lord is close to the brokenhearted."

1229
01:19:57,090 --> 01:20:01,890
Psalam 34 kaže: "Gospodin je blizu onima slomljenog srca."

1230
01:20:02,310 --> 01:20:04,410
And saves those who are crushed in spirit.

1231
01:20:05,010 --> 01:20:06,690
I spašava one koji su klonuli.

1232
01:20:07,410 --> 01:20:09,330
But I also realized I couldn't do it alone.

1233
01:20:09,510 --> 01:20:11,730
Ali sam isto tako shvatio da ne mogu to učiniti sam.

1234
01:20:12,450 --> 01:20:15,510
So I nervously called a friend who actually introduced my wife and I.

1235
01:20:16,470 --> 01:20:19,470
I brzo sam nazvao prijatelja koji je upoznao mene i moju suprugu.

1236
01:20:20,250 --> 01:20:23,250
And he listened, he spoke life into me.

1237
01:20:23,490 --> 01:20:26,610
Posaslušao me, oživio me na neki način.

1238
01:20:26,910 --> 01:20:30,210
He invited me to pray a novena to Our Lady Undoer of Knots.

1239
01:20:31,050 --> 01:20:34,410
Pozvao me da izmolim devetnicu Gospi koja razvezuje čvorove.

1240
01:20:35,310 --> 01:20:37,290
And if you haven't prayed that, watch out.

1241
01:20:38,010 --> 01:20:39,750
Ako to niste izmolili, pazite se.

1242
01:20:40,890 --> 01:20:43,350
But leaving that conversation, he helped me and

1243
01:20:44,610 --> 01:20:47,550
he gave me advice to go approach my wife about two things.

1244
01:20:48,450 --> 01:20:51,870
I dao mi je savjet da pristupim supruzi s dvije stvari.

1245
01:20:52,710 --> 01:20:56,730
I asked her if she'd be willing to join me on her own in this novena.

1246
01:20:58,530 --> 01:21:02,790
Zamolio sam je da mi se pridruži u ovoj devetnici i da ju sama izmoli.

1247
01:21:03,210 --> 01:21:06,330
And if she could schedule to talk with a priest about the state of our marriage.

1248
01:21:06,630 --> 01:21:10,470
I ako može zakazati razgovor sa svećenikom o stanju našeg braka.

1249
01:21:10,770 --> 01:21:15,510
And because of where we were at, I was actually surprised that she agreed to do both these things.

1250
01:21:15,690 --> 01:21:19,350
I zbog stanja u kojem smo se nalazili, začudilo me što je pristala na obje stvari.

1251
01:21:19,830 --> 01:21:26,310
And I had not seen many miracles up to that point, but over those next 9 days, things shifted.

1252
01:21:26,970 --> 01:21:32,250
Do tada nisam vidio puno čudesa, ali u idućih 9 dana toliko se toga promijenilo.

1253
01:21:32,790 --> 01:21:38,970
My wife's best friend reached out to her and started challenging her to seek the truth about our marriage.

1254
01:21:39,870 --> 01:21:46,410
Njena najbolja prijateljica moje žene joj se javila i izazvala ju da počne tražiti što je istina o našem braku.

1255
01:21:46,770 --> 01:21:54,090
And since I wasn't getting through to my wife, I decided to look if there was anything within me that needed healing on my own.

1256
01:21:54,510 --> 01:22:00,270
Budući da nisam mogao doprijeti do svoje supruge, odlučio sam istražiti što je to u meni čemu je potrebno ozdravljenje.

1257
01:22:00,990 --> 01:22:03,450
I came across a healing prayer for breaking soul ties.

1258
01:22:05,610 --> 01:22:10,890
Naletio sam na molitvu koja razdvaja

1259
01:22:13,470 --> 01:22:15,810
duševne veze, slamа duševne veze.

1260
01:22:16,170 --> 01:22:20,730
If you don't know, soul ties are inordinate attachments we create with others.

1261
01:22:21,750 --> 01:22:26,670
Ako ne znate, duševne veze su neuredne veze koje stvaramo s drugima.

1262
01:22:27,270 --> 01:22:31,290
When we give our heart to someone, we give them authority over us.

1263
01:22:31,350 --> 01:22:34,590
Kada nekome damo svoje srce, kao da mu damo autoritet nad nama.

1264
01:22:34,770 --> 01:22:35,910
And we become tied to them.

1265
01:22:36,090 --> 01:22:37,530
I postajemo vezani za njih.

1266
01:22:37,650 --> 01:22:41,430
And one of the most common ways this happens is through sexual activity outside of marriage.

1267
01:22:41,670 --> 01:22:44,190
I jedan od najčešćih načina kako se to dogodi je kroz

1268
01:22:45,750 --> 01:22:46,950
spolni odnos izvan braka.

1269
01:22:47,850 --> 01:22:51,270
So I'll share with you guys, I had a past.

1270
01:22:51,450 --> 01:22:53,250
Podijelit ću s vama da sam imao prošlost.

1271
01:22:53,430 --> 01:22:55,230
Of looking for love in all the wrong places.

1272
01:22:55,530 --> 01:22:57,270
Tražeći ljubav na svim krivim mjestima.

1273
01:22:57,750 --> 01:23:00,270
My relationships turned very physical very fast.

1274
01:23:00,570 --> 01:23:03,690
Moje veze su postajale jako fizičke jako brzo.

1275
01:23:03,930 --> 01:23:05,370
There was a lot of sin and shame.

1276
01:23:05,790 --> 01:23:09,450
Bilo je jako puno grijeha i srama.

1277
01:23:09,870 --> 01:23:13,290
And when I wasn't in a relationship, I turned to the internet and consumed.

1278
01:23:13,650 --> 01:23:18,330
I kada nisam bio u vezi, išao bih na internet i konzumirao sadržaj tamo.

1279
01:23:18,690 --> 01:23:23,970
So I find this prayer and I feel the Lord asking me to write down every name.

1280
01:23:24,210 --> 01:23:30,090
Našao sam tu molitvu i osjetio kao da me Gospodin poziva da zapišem svako ime.

1281
01:23:30,930 --> 01:23:34,230
Not just physical intimacy, but anyone I ever lusted after.

1282
01:23:34,770 --> 01:23:41,010
Ne samo fizička intimnost, nego bilo koga s kim sam s požudom vapio ili gledao.

1283
01:23:41,790 --> 01:23:45,270
I'll be honest with you, I had hundreds and hundreds of names written down.

1284
01:23:45,510 --> 01:23:48,510
Moram vam priznati da sam imao stotine i stotine imena zapisanih.

1285
01:23:48,570 --> 01:23:49,410
I'm not proud of that.

1286
01:23:49,650 --> 01:23:50,730
Nisam ponosan na to.

1287
01:23:53,250 --> 01:23:59,430
But I felt the Lord saying, "Where I previously used them and objectified them for my own pleasure."

1288
01:23:59,730 --> 01:24:05,070
Osjetio sam da mi Gospodin govori gdje sam ih prije objektivizirao i koristio za vlastitu

1289
01:24:06,630 --> 01:24:08,910
korist i užitak.

1290
01:24:09,630 --> 01:24:13,230
I now owed it to them, for their dignity and my own to pray this prayer.

1291
01:24:14,250 --> 01:24:18,870
Osjetio sam dužnost da zbog svog dostojanstva i njihovog dostojanstva izmolim ovu molitvu.

1292
01:24:19,110 --> 01:24:21,750
And I'll use it an example of, say, a celebrity.

1293
01:24:22,470 --> 01:24:25,710
I iskoristit ću primjer s jednom poznatom osobom.

1294
01:24:26,190 --> 01:24:31,050
I said, "In the name of Jesus, I forgive this celebrity for presenting her body in a sexual way."

1295
01:24:31,230 --> 01:24:40,170
U ime Isusovo, opraštam toj poznatoj osobi što je svoje tijelo koristila na seksualni način.

1296
01:24:40,710 --> 01:24:44,010
I forgive the people who own the website who promoted this.

1297
01:24:44,370 --> 01:24:48,630
Opraštam ljudima koji su vlasnici te stranice, koji su to promovirali.

1298
01:24:49,050 --> 01:24:52,470
And in the name of Jesus, I break my soul tie with this celebrity.

1299
01:24:52,650 --> 01:24:57,390
I u ime Isusovo, slamam duševnu vezu s tom poznatom osobom.

1300
01:24:57,690 --> 01:25:00,990
I take back the authority that I gave them by lusting after them.

1301
01:25:02,190 --> 01:25:07,410
Vraćam autoritet koji sam im dao time što sam požudno čeznuo za njima.

1302
01:25:07,770 --> 01:25:09,930
And I take back anything they took from me.

1303
01:25:10,170 --> 01:25:12,090
I uzimam nazad sve što su uzeli od mene.

1304
01:25:12,270 --> 01:25:14,130
I wash our history in the blood of Jesus.

1305
01:25:14,550 --> 01:25:17,070
I perem našu povijest u krvi Kristovoj.

1306
01:25:17,430 --> 01:25:19,290
And Father, I ask that You would bless them today.

1307
01:25:19,710 --> 01:25:21,570
I Oče, molim Te da ih blagosloviš danas.

1308
01:25:21,870 --> 01:25:23,850
And lead them to any repentance they need.

1309
01:25:24,330 --> 01:25:27,990
I vodi ih prema svakom pokajanju koje im je potrebno.

1310
01:25:28,350 --> 01:25:29,970
And lead them to a relationship with You.

1311
01:25:30,210 --> 01:25:32,550
I vodi ih do odnosa s Tobom.

1312
01:25:33,270 --> 01:25:34,890
I did this for every single one.

1313
01:25:35,070 --> 01:25:36,810
Činio sam to za svaku osobu.

1314
01:25:37,110 --> 01:25:38,130
It was a really long day.

1315
01:25:38,550 --> 01:25:39,810
Bio je jako dugačak dan.

1316
01:25:40,410 --> 01:25:43,770
And over the years, if somebody new pops into my head, I do it for them too.

1317
01:25:43,890 --> 01:25:46,950
I kroz godine, ako mi netko novi padne na pamet, ponovno to učinim.

1318
01:25:47,430 --> 01:25:48,870
And here's something I want you to hear.

1319
01:25:49,290 --> 01:25:50,790
I ovo je nešto što želim da čujete.

1320
01:25:51,750 --> 01:25:54,510
The power that those temptations had over me.

1321
01:25:54,750 --> 01:25:57,750
Snaga koju su te napasti imale nada mnom.

1322
01:25:57,990 --> 01:26:01,470
Where I was white-knuckling it like just to hang on to purity.

1323
01:26:02,250 --> 01:26:06,030
Gdje sam se grčevito borio da zadržim čistoću.

1324
01:26:06,630 --> 01:26:08,250
When I finished praying that prayer.

1325
01:26:08,730 --> 01:26:10,230
Kad sam završio s tim molitvama.

1326
01:26:11,070 --> 01:26:13,590
That power broke, and I haven't felt it again.

1327
01:26:14,370 --> 01:26:17,790
Ta snaga se slomila i nisam je više ponovno osjetio.

1328
01:26:23,190 --> 01:26:24,030
Now that's a grace.

1329
01:26:25,350 --> 01:26:26,070
Sad to je milost.

1330
01:26:29,490 --> 01:26:31,770
And I want to be clear, I still get tempted.

1331
01:26:32,310 --> 01:26:34,710
Želim biti jasan, i dalje osjećam napasti.

1332
01:26:35,070 --> 01:26:36,390
Beautiful women are everywhere.

1333
01:26:36,750 --> 01:26:37,950
Prekrasne žene su svuda.

1334
01:26:38,970 --> 01:26:44,490
But when the temptations come, it's so obvious that I can just look at it and say, "No, go away."

1335
01:26:44,670 --> 01:26:49,170
Kad napast dođe, toliko su jasne da mogu samo reći: "Ne, odlazi od mene."

1336
01:26:49,470 --> 01:26:50,190
It's not worth it.

1337
01:26:50,430 --> 01:26:51,210
Nije vrijedno toga.

1338
01:26:51,510 --> 01:26:52,050
I'm taken.

1339
01:26:52,770 --> 01:26:53,850
Ja sam zauzet.

1340
01:26:54,270 --> 01:26:56,190
And I didn't realize that then, but I do now.

1341
01:26:56,370 --> 01:26:58,290
To tada nisam shvaćao, ali sada shvaćam.

1342
01:26:59,790 --> 01:27:03,990
So I remember I went to my wife Rose and told her I wasn't expecting anything of her.

1343
01:27:04,170 --> 01:27:09,630
Sjećam se da sam otišao do svoje supruge Rose i nisam ništa očekivao od nje, samo sam joj rekao.

1344
01:27:09,870 --> 01:27:12,210
But I just wanted to be transparent before her.

1345
01:27:12,450 --> 01:27:14,850
Želio sam biti otvoren s njom, transparentan.

1346
01:27:15,450 --> 01:27:19,890
So I repented for not putting her first and being sensitive to her needs.

1347
01:27:20,190 --> 01:27:25,410
Pokajao sam se što je nisam stavljao na prvo mjesto i što nisam bio pažljiv s njenim osjećajima.

1348
01:27:25,650 --> 01:27:31,530
And I shared with her things that I'd gone to confession for, that I'd been absolved for, but had never shared with her.

1349
01:27:31,830 --> 01:27:37,350
Podijelio sam stvari zbog kojih sam bio na ispovijedi, od kojih sam odriješen, ali nisam s njom pričao o tome.

1350
01:27:37,890 --> 01:27:41,850
And I remember my wife looked at me and she said, "Thank you for sharing."

1351
01:27:42,570 --> 01:27:46,530
I sjećam se kako me supruga pogledala i rekla: "Hvala ti što si to podijelio sa mnom."

1352
01:27:46,950 --> 01:27:48,210
But that doesn't change how I feel.

1353
01:27:48,570 --> 01:27:50,250
Ali to ne mijenja kako se ja osjećam.

1354
01:27:50,970 --> 01:27:55,770
And it sounds very strange, but I was so relieved to hear her say that.

1355
01:27:56,250 --> 01:28:00,090
I znam da zvuči čudno, ali mi je bilo jako olakšavajuće kad sam to čuo.

1356
01:28:01,110 --> 01:28:05,370
Because I knew in that moment I had nothing left to surrender.

1357
01:28:05,730 --> 01:28:08,430
Jer znao sam da u tom trenutku više nemam ništa za predati.

1358
01:28:09,210 --> 01:28:11,010
So I could stop beating myself up.

1359
01:28:11,250 --> 01:28:13,590
Mogao sam prestati sam sebe izjedati.

1360
01:28:14,130 --> 01:28:17,250
It's like I was flat on my face, I couldn't dig a deeper hole.

1361
01:28:17,910 --> 01:28:20,910
Toliko sam nisko pao da više nisam mogao iskopati dublju rupu.

1362
01:28:21,330 --> 01:28:28,650
And I feel like God the Father broke in in that moment and said, "Kevin, your wife's pain has very little to do with you."

1363
01:28:29,250 --> 01:28:35,670
I kao da je Bog Otac došao i rekao: "Kevine, žena, bol tvoje žene ima jako malo veze s tobom."

1364
01:28:36,090 --> 01:28:42,390
And in that moment, I felt like my prayer could shift from me asking the Lord to save my marriage.

1365
01:28:43,170 --> 01:28:49,650
I osjetio sam kao da se od tog trenutka moja molitva može usmjeriti od toga da molim da Bog spasi moj brak.

1366
01:28:50,130 --> 01:28:59,010
And instead, I could start praying for my wife and say, "Lord, I want her healing, what she's struggling through, I want that completely restored."

1367
01:28:59,250 --> 01:29:04,590
Kao da sam mogao početi moliti za ozdravljenje moje žene da ju Bog potpuno oslobodi.

1368
01:29:04,770 --> 01:29:09,150
And I started feeling waves of the Lord's consolations flowing over me.

1369
01:29:09,210 --> 01:29:13,350
I mogao sam osjetiti kao valove Božje milosti i utjehe koji su me preplavljivali.

1370
01:29:14,190 --> 01:29:17,370
Days later, my wife came over to me to apologize.

1371
01:29:17,490 --> 01:29:20,730
Nakon nekoliko dana, supruga mi je došla da bi mi se ispričala.

1372
01:29:21,450 --> 01:29:27,090
For letting her heart wander and being closed off to the possibility that the Lord would heal her in our marriage.

1373
01:29:27,510 --> 01:29:34,050
Da mi se ispriča zato što je pustila da njeno srce odluta i zatvori se za mogućnost ozdravljenja unutar našeg braka.

1374
01:29:34,530 --> 01:29:39,090
And she humbly shared how she went to the Lord and He exposed the lie.

1375
01:29:39,930 --> 01:29:45,270
I ponizno mi je objavila da je ona išla u molitvu pred Gospodina i On joj je objavio tu laž.

1376
01:29:45,630 --> 01:29:52,110
She confessed her hope that moving on from me would help to heal her heart, and the Lord actually told her, "No."

1377
01:29:52,710 --> 01:30:00,810
I rekla mi je kako je podijelila s Bogom nadu da će odlazak od mene pomoći u ozdravljenju, a Bog joj je rekao ne.

1378
01:30:01,350 --> 01:30:07,530
And I could see on her face as she's sharing this, there was this helplessness, like she realized she had been deceived.

1379
01:30:07,890 --> 01:30:14,730
I vidio sam na njenom licu dok je to dijelila sa mnom, kao jednu bespomoćnost, jer je bila obmanjena.

1380
01:30:17,550 --> 01:30:21,870
And as she's sharing this, I am so shocked to hear these words coming out of her mouth.

1381
01:30:21,990 --> 01:30:27,210
Kako je to dijelila sa mnom, bio sam toliko šokiran s riječima koje su izlazile iz njezinih usta.

1382
01:30:27,510 --> 01:30:30,030
But I knew there was a cry for help in what she was saying.

1383
01:30:30,270 --> 01:30:32,310
Ali znao sam da je to bio jedan vapaj za pomoć.

1384
01:30:32,790 --> 01:30:35,670
Guys, it's never been so easy for me to forgive someone.

1385
01:30:35,850 --> 01:30:38,190
Nikad mi nije bilo toliko lako nekome oprostiti.

1386
01:30:39,270 --> 01:30:43,890
And I knew I was so committed to do anything I could do to help her through that.

1387
01:30:44,130 --> 01:30:47,730
Znao sam da sam toliko predan učiniti sve što treba da joj pomognem.

1388
01:30:48,270 --> 01:30:49,230
Love is not pompous.

1389
01:30:49,890 --> 01:30:50,850
