1404
01:31:24,630 --> 01:31:28,530
Okay. That's a lot for you to repeat. Go for it.

1405
01:31:28,770 --> 01:31:33,150
To je jako puno za ponoviti. Ne pamtim zlo,

1406
01:31:35,610 --> 01:31:40,470
