1407
01:31:43,530 --> 01:31:56,010
Just pay attention to how that feels. Saint Francis de Sales, he once called marriage a perpetual exercise in mortification.

1408
01:31:57,450 --> 01:32:03,870
Sveti Franjo Saleški je nazvao brak neprestana vježba u

1409
