1410
01:32:07,170 --> 01:32:08,490
Because every day we're getting holy.

1411
01:32:08,910 --> 01:32:10,710
Jer svakog dana postajemo sve svetiji.

1412
01:32:11,310 --> 01:32:14,970
So as my wife and I received grace to shift the blame off of each other.

1413
01:32:15,270 --> 01:32:20,730
Kako smo supruga i ja primili milost da se prestanemo okrivljivati jedno drugo.

1414
01:32:20,970 --> 01:32:24,030
