So that same day as we're talking about it, we invited over some of her trusted family members.

1433
01:33:32,610 --> 01:33:41,130
I dok smo razgovarali o tome, tog dana smo pozvali u goste neke od ljudi iz njene obitelji kojima smo mogli vjerovati.

1434
01:33:41,250 --> 01:33:41,910
