Pronađem doktora Boba Schutza.

1451
01:34:39,570 --> 01:34:42,810
Two weeks later, there's an event that's happening two hours north of us.

1452
01:34:43,230 --> 01:34:47,250
Dva tjedna iza toga, dva sata od nas, imaju konferenciju.

1453
01:34:47,490 --> 01:34:48,630
And they still have space.

1454
