1455
01:34:50,910 --> 01:34:53,310
So we make plans and we go to this healing conference.

1456
01:34:53,430 --> 01:34:55,590
Sve smo isplanirali i otišli smo na konferenciju.

1457
01:34:56,130 --> 01:34:59,430
At some point on the second day, they're praying for physical healing.

1458
01:34:59,790 --> 01:35:03,090
U jednom trenutku drugog dana mole za fizičko ozdravljenje.

1459
01:35:03,330 --> 01:35:05,670
And this group of ladies gathers around my wife.

1460
01:35:05,910 --> 01:35:08,970
I ova grupa gospođa se okupi oko moje supruge.

1461
01:35:09,270 --> 01:35:15,570
One of the ladies, she says she starts feeling this intense pain in her stomach, and she thinks that maybe it's a sympathy pain for my wife.

1462
01:35:15,990 --> 01:35:20,730
I u jednom trenutku jedna od gospođa počinje osjećati bol u trbuhu i misli da je to

1463
01:35:22,050 --> 01:35:25,350
