1473
01:35:59,130 --> 01:36:00,570
Jeste li čuli za celijakiju?

1474
01:36:00,750 --> 01:36:01,830
Yeah, it runs in her family.

1475
01:36:02,010 --> 01:36:03,510
To je u cijeloj njenoj obitelji.

1476
01:36:03,810 --> 01:36:08,190
Well, after that prayer, we discovered weeks later she was completely healed physically.

1477
01:36:08,370 --> 01:36:13,350
Nakon te molitve shvatili smo da je, nakon nekoliko tjedana, shvatili smo da je potpuno ozdravila od celijakije.

1478
01:36:13,710 --> 01:36:15,150
Now she eats more bread than I do.

1479
01:36:15,270 --> 01:36:16,710
Sad jede više kruha nego ja.

1480
01:36:16,890 --> 01:36:18,210
Which is really great in Croatia.

1481
