1482
01:36:21,690 --> 01:36:25,290
But the other thing that happened at this conference, this healing the whole person conference.

1483
01:36:25,470 --> 01:36:29,550
Druga stvar koja se dogodila na toj konferenciji za ozdravljenje cijele osobe.

1484
