I počela je identificirati neka vjerovanja koja je imala i koja je nosila od tada.

1490
01:36:53,670 --> 01:36:55,590
Beliefs about herself, full of shame.

1491
01:36:56,010 --> 01:36:58,350
Vjerovanja o sebi, puna srama.

1492
01:36:58,770 --> 01:37:00,090
That she was bad and dirty.

1493
01:37:00,510 --> 01:37:02,610
Da je bila loša, da je bila prljava.

1494
01:37:03,090 --> 01:37:05,610
She had beliefs about men, that they couldn't be trusted.

1495
01:37:05,970 --> 01:37:08,490
Imala je vjerovanje da se muškarcima ne može vjerovati.

1496
01:37:09,030 --> 01:37:12,930
And she had beliefs about God, that she couldn't be protected and she was abandoned.

1497
01:37:13,170 --> 01:37:16,230
Imala je vjerovanje da se Bogu ne može vjerovati, da je ostavljena.

1498
01:37:16,710 --> 01:37:21,090
And those beliefs, they continued over the course of her life and grew stronger.

1499
01:37:21,750 --> 01:37:26,490
Ta vjerovanja su se nastavila u njenom životu i samo jačala i osnaživala se.

1500
