I stvarala su ove velike blokade u njenom odnosu s Bogom i s ljudima.

1502
01:37:37,710 --> 01:37:42,450
For over 30 years, simply because a man chose to be a predator instead of a protector.

1503
01:37:42,810 --> 01:37:47,910
Gotovo 30 godina nakon što je jedan muškarac odlučio biti predator, a ne zaštitnik.

1504
01:37:48,990 --> 01:37:52,410
Discovering this was so huge for our relationship.

1505
