1513
01:38:15,810 --> 01:38:17,370
Pozvala je Isusa u to sjećanje.

1514
01:38:18,270 --> 01:38:21,930
She felt His heart for her and for her abuser.

1515
01:38:22,470 --> 01:38:27,090
Osjetila je Njegovo suosjećanje i za nju i za njenog zlostavljača.

1516
01:38:27,450 --> 01:38:29,070
And she forgave that family member.

1517
01:38:29,370 --> 01:38:31,050
I oprostila je tom članu obitelji.

1518
01:38:31,290 --> 01:38:32,610
And then she came and found me.

1519
01:38:32,910 --> 01:38:34,290
I onda je došla i pronašla mene.

1520
01:38:34,470 --> 01:38:35,370
And she told me.

1521
01:38:35,670 --> 01:38:36,390
I rekla mi je.

1522
01:38:36,690 --> 01:38:42,150
And then together we walked up the center aisle and we just stood at the altar giving thanks to the Lord.

1523
01:38:42,570 --> 01:38:47,730
Zajedno smo prošli kroz središnji dio i stali pred oltarom, kleknuli i dali hvalu Bogu.

1524
01:38:48,930 --> 01:38:50,190
Love is not quick-tempered.

1525
01:38:50,850 --> 01:38:55,230
Ljubav nije brzopleta.

1526
01:38:55,530 --> 01:38:57,930
It does not brood over injury.

1527
01:38:58,470 --> 01:39:00,090
Ne raduje se nepravdi.

1528
01:39:00,390 --> 01:39:02,790
It does not rejoice over wrongdoing.

1529
01:39:03,990 --> 01:39:08,730
Ne raduje se grijehu.

1530
01:39:09,150 --> 01:39:10,530
But it rejoices with the truth.

1531
01:39:10,770 --> 01:39:11,610
Raduje se istini.

1532
01:39:13,170 --> 01:39:14,070
Here's our last one.

1533
01:39:14,430 --> 01:39:15,090
Evo zadnje.

1534
01:39:15,570 --> 01:39:17,730
Love bears all things.

1535
01:39:17,910 --> 01:39:18,990
Ljubav sve podnosi.

1536
01:39:19,410 --> 01:39:20,490
Believes all things.

1537
01:39:20,910 --> 01:39:21,630
Svemu vjeruje.

1538
01:39:22,050 --> 01:39:23,070
Hopes all things.

1539
01:39:23,250 --> 01:39:24,810
Sve pokriva, svemu se nada.

1540
01:39:25,050 --> 01:39:25,950
Endures all things.

1541
01:39:26,190 --> 01:39:26,850
Sve podnosi.

1542
01:39:27,570 --> 01:39:30,750
So go ahead and declare this, "I bear all things."

1543
01:39:30,930 --> 01:39:32,010
Ja sve pokrivam.

1544
01:39:33,930 --> 01:39:34,770
I believe all things.

1545
01:39:34,890 --> 01:39:35,490
Svemu vjerujem.

1546
01:39:36,990 --> 01:39:37,710
I hope all things.

1547
01:39:37,710 --> 01:39:38,430
Svemu se nadam.

1548
01:39:39,750 --> 01:39:40,710
I endure all things.

1549
01:39:40,950 --> 01:39:41,790
Sve podnosim.

1550
01:39:44,130 --> 01:39:45,390
Just pay attention to how that feels.

1551
01:39:46,170 --> 01:39:49,290
Slušajte kako to odzvanja.

1552
01:39:53,730 --> 01:39:58,890
So I mentioned to you, discovery of the wound, the root, is just the first step.

1553
01:39:59,370 --> 01:40:02,550
Otkrivanje korijena rane je samo prvi korak.

1554
01:40:04,050 --> 01:40:05,670
There is always more healing.

1555
01:40:06,750 --> 01:40:09,090
Postoji uvijek više ozdravljenja.

1556
01:40:09,630 --> 01:40:13,470
