1557
01:40:13,650 --> 01:40:17,730
Zato što je uvijek dostupno još više Isusove ljubavi.

1558
01:40:18,150 --> 01:40:21,090
Even at this conference, I had a radical healing of my own.

1559
01:40:21,390 --> 01:40:24,990
Čak i na toj konferenciji sam i ja imao jedno radikalno iskustvo ozdravljenja.

1560
01:40:25,230 --> 01:40:28,830
And a restoration in my relationship with my father.

1561
01:40:29,010 --> 01:40:31,590
I ozdravljenje u svom odnosu s Ocem.

1562
01:40:32,670 --> 01:40:33,930
I can't share about that today.

1563
01:40:34,290 --> 01:40:35,250
Ne mogu danas o tome.

1564
01:40:36,150 --> 01:40:39,270
But we came out of it knowing we were committed to the healing journey.

1565
01:40:39,750 --> 01:40:45,270
Ali izašli smo iz te konferencije znajući da se predajemo putovanju iscjeljenja.

1566
01:40:45,810 --> 01:40:48,390
And for us, it involved counseling.

1567
01:40:48,870 --> 01:40:52,290
Za nas je to uključivalo savjetovanje.

1568
01:40:52,650 --> 01:40:55,530
It involved many prayers and sessions of deliverance.

1569
01:40:55,770 --> 01:40:58,230
Puno molitvi oslobođenja i ozdravljenja.

1570
01:40:59,010 --> 01:41:02,430
But through it, we discovered the depths of God's love for us.

1571
01:41:02,550 --> 01:41:05,310
Ali kroz to smo otkrili bogatstvo Božje ljubavi za nas.

1572
01:41:05,430 --> 01:41:09,450
And we discovered the weight of what saying "I do" really means.

1573
01:41:09,870 --> 01:41:12,570
I otkrili smo što točno znači "da"

1574
01:41:14,430 --> 01:41:14,970
u braku.

1575
01:41:15,570 --> 01:41:18,930
So I want to make this practical for those of you that are married in this room.

1576
01:41:19,290 --> 01:41:23,070
Želim sad učiniti ovo sve praktičnim za one koji su ovdje vjenčani.

1577
01:41:23,670 --> 01:41:26,010
I want you to renew your commitment to your spouse.

1578
01:41:26,310 --> 01:41:30,390
Želim da obnovite svoje predanje svojoj suprugu ili supruzi.

1579
01:41:31,170 --> 01:41:34,830
So I'm going to lead you through the words that many of you have said on your wedding day.

1580
01:41:35,070 --> 01:41:39,030
Vodit ću vas kroz riječi koje ste izrekli na svom danu vjenčanja.

1581
01:41:39,390 --> 01:41:40,890
Many of you haven't said them since.

1582
01:41:41,310 --> 01:41:42,810
Mnogi ih od tad niste izrekli.

1583
01:41:44,550 --> 01:41:45,750
But here's what I want you to do.

1584
01:41:45,990 --> 01:41:47,010
Želim da ovo učinite.

1585
01:41:47,550 --> 01:41:51,510
If your spouse is here, I want you to turn to them and hold their hands in your hands.

1586
01:41:51,690 --> 01:41:55,530
Ako je vaš supružnik ili supruga ovdje, okrenite se i uzmite im ruku.

1587
01:41:55,890 --> 01:41:57,390
And I want you to look them in the eyes.

1588
01:41:57,570 --> 01:41:58,530
Gledajte ih u oči.

1589
01:41:59,070 --> 01:42:05,250
If they're not here, I want you to close your eyes and imagine them in front of you as if they were.

1590
01:42:05,430 --> 01:42:08,430
Ako niste ovdje, zatvorite oči i zamislite kao da su tu.

1591
01:42:10,230 --> 01:42:14,130
If you hope to be married and they're not here, just say this to your future spouse.

1592
01:42:14,550 --> 01:42:18,630
Ako se nadate da ćete se vjenčati, zatvorite oči i recite svom budućem supružniku.

1593
01:42:19,050 --> 01:42:21,270
If you're consecrated, say this to Jesus.

1594
01:42:21,750 --> 01:42:23,790
Ako ste posvećeni, recite to Isusu.

1595
01:42:27,090 --> 01:42:28,350
And just repeat this after me.

1596
01:42:28,470 --> 01:42:29,610
Ponavljajte ovo za mnom.

1597
01:42:30,210 --> 01:42:31,230
I, say your name.

1598
01:42:31,830 --> 01:42:33,210
Ja, recite svoje ime.

1599
01:42:33,990 --> 01:42:35,370
Take you, say their name.

1600
01:42:35,490 --> 01:42:37,470
Uzimam tebe, recite ime.

1601
01:42:38,010 --> 01:42:39,810
To be my wife or husband.

1602
01:42:39,930 --> 01:42:41,430
Da bude moj muž ili žena.

1603
01:42:42,930 --> 01:42:44,370
I promise to be true to you.

1604
01:42:45,150 --> 01:42:48,390
Obećajem ti vjernost.

1605
01:42:48,570 --> 01:42:49,950
In good times and in bad.

1606
01:42:50,190 --> 01:42:51,090
U dobru i u zlu.

1607
01:42:53,010 --> 01:42:54,510
In sickness and in health.

1608
01:42:54,810 --> 01:42:56,010
U zdravlju i bolesti.

1609
01:42:56,910 --> 01:42:58,650
I will love you and honor you.

1610
01:42:59,310 --> 01:43:00,810
Da ću te ljubiti i poštovati.

1611
01:43:01,710 --> 01:43:02,790
All the days of my life.

1612
01:43:02,970 --> 01:43:04,110
Sve dane života moga.
